ull, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"低沉的神秘声音，轻微的环境音效如风声\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Mysterious low voice, subtle environmental sounds\", \"timingNote\": \"对白较长，原时长 5s 调整为 7s，确保台词完整传达神秘感。\"}]}, {\"id\": \"scene-160a0af3bcfd\", \"sceneNumber\": 5, \"title\": \"演武场的坦白\", \"description\": \"灵儿站在演武场上，手持长剑，眼神坚定，向长老和李元婴表达立场。\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"shots\": [{\"id\": \"shot-62745c1af9de\", \"shotNumber\": 7, \"title\": \"灵儿的坚定\", \"description\": \"灵儿站在演武场上，手持长剑，眼神坚定，向长老和李元婴表达立场。\", \"promptText\": \"[Shot 7] A determined figure facing an audience in a martial arena. At 00:00.000, Ling\'er stands tall, sword held firmly. At 00:02.000, she looks directly at the camera. Ling\'er says: <d>[Chinese] 我承认我有错，但那灵石是我的师门传承，我绝不会放弃。</d> Cinematic shot emphasizing emotional resolve.\", \"dialogue\": \"灵儿: （坚定）长老，我承认我有错，但那灵石是我的师门传承，我绝不会放弃。\", \"characterNames\": [\"灵儿\"], \"characterBindings\": [{\"characterId\": \"char-f93ded097434\", \"lookId\": \"look-default\"}], \"assetBindingMode\": \"stable\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"locationId\": \"loc-52e78f37adb8\", \"propIds\": [], \"propNames\": [], \"durationSec\": 6, \"compiledPrompt\": \"\", \"jobId\": null, \"status\": \"idle\", \"outputVideoUrl\": null, \"progress\": 0, \"takes\": [], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": null, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"剑鞘轻响，灵儿坚定的语气\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Slight sheath clink, firm tone of dialogue\", \"timingNote\": \"对白长度增加，原时长 5s 调整为 6s，确保情感表达充分。\"}, {\"id\": \"shot-8e64ac05cf08\", \"shotNumber\": 8, \"title\": \"长老的建议\", \"description\": \"宗门长老叹息，提议寻找真相，缓解紧张气氛。\", \"promptText\": \"[Shot 8] An elder suggesting reconciliation in a grand martial arena. At 00:00.000, the Elder sighs deeply. At 00:01.500, he looks at Ling\'er. The Elder says: <d>[Chinese] 灵儿，你的心中，藏着一段不为人知的往事。若你想彻底解决此事，不如随我去寻找真相。</d> Emotional storytelling with rich atmosphere.\", \"dialogue\": \"宗门长老: （叹息）灵儿，你的心中，藏着一段不为人知的往事。若你想彻底解决此事，不如随我去寻找真相。\", \"characterNames\": [\"宗门长老\"], \"characterBindings\": [], \"assetBindingMode\": \"stable\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"locationId\": \"loc-52e78f37adb8\", \"propIds\": [], \"propNames\": [], \"durationSec\": 6, \"compiledPrompt\": \"\", \"jobId\": null, \"status\": \"idle\", \"outputVideoUrl\": null, \"progress\": 0, \"takes\": [], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": null, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"叹息声，环境音效渐缓\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Sighing sound, calming ambient effects\", \"timingNote\": \"对白较长，原时长 5s 调整为 6.5s，确保台词完整传达建议的诚恳。\"}]}, {\"id\": \"scene-3c1f7982c7cf\", \"sceneNumber\": 6, \"title\": \"古战场的发现\", \"description\": \"在古战场上，尘封的遗迹被揭开，李元婴和灵儿发现一块古老的石碑，引发好奇。\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗古战场\", \"shots\": [{\"id\": \"shot-dea08fc6f589\", \"shotNumber\": 9, \"title\": \"石碑的揭示\", \"description\": \"在古战场上，尘封的遗迹被揭开，李元婴和灵儿发现一块古老的石碑，引发好奇。\", \"promptText\": \"[Shot 9] Ancient ruins unearthed on a mystical battlefield. At 00:00.000, Li Yuanying and Ling\'er discover an ancient stone tablet. At 00:02.000, Ling\'er examines the tablet closely. Ling\'er says: <d>[Chinese] 这石碑……难道是传说中的……</d> At 00:04.000, Li Yuanying responds: <d>[Chinese] 传说中的什么？</d> At 00:06.000, Ling\'er looks up: <d>[Chinese] 传说，这石碑记载着一段被遗忘的历史，一段关于你和我的历史。</d> Epic cinematic with rich visual details.\", \"dialogue\": \"灵儿: （惊讶）这石碑……难道是传说中的…… 李元婴: （疑惑）传说中的什么？ 灵儿: （抬头）传说，这石碑记载着一段被遗忘的历史，一段关于你和我的历史。\", \"characterNames\": [\"灵儿\", \"李元婴\"], \"characterBindings\": [{\"characterId\": \"char-f93ded097434\", \"lookId\": \"look-default\"}], \"assetBindingMode\": \"stable\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗古战场\", \"locationId\": \"loc-bc63a80d5a06\", \"propIds\": [], \"propNames\": [], \"durationSec\": 8, \"compiledPrompt\": \"\", \"jobId\": null, \"status\": \"idle\", \"outputVideoUrl\": null, \"progress\": 0, \"takes\": [], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": null, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"石碑摩擦声，风声伴奏\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Stone scraping sound, wind accompanying\", \"timingNote\": \"对白较多，原时长 5s 调整为 8s，确保历史感的铺垫充分。\"}]}, {\"id\": \"scene-c568d3d91cb8\", \"sceneNumber\": 7, \"title\": \"演武场的真相\", \"description\": \"宗门长老严肃地揭示李元婴和灵儿的前世联系，灵儿震惊不已。\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"shots\": [{\"id\": \"shot-345e2c70d12b\", \"shotNumber\": 10, \"title\": \"长老的揭示\", \"description\": \"宗门长老严肃地揭示李元婴和灵儿的前世联系，灵儿震惊不已。\", \"promptText\": \"[Shot 10] A stern elder revealing a shocking truth in a martial arena. At 00:00.000, the Elder speaks: <d>[Chinese] 灵儿，你与元婴，确有前世之缘。当年，你为救他，不惜牺牲自己，这才有了今日的你。</d> At 00:04.000, Ling\'er looks stunned. Dramatic lighting with emotional impact.\", \"dialogue\": \"长老: （严肃）灵儿，你与元婴，确有前世之缘。当年，你为救他，不惜牺牲自己，这才有了今日的你。 灵儿: （震惊）你……你说什么？\", \"characterNames\": [\"灵儿\", \"宗门长老\"], \"characterBindings\": [{\"characterId\": \"char-f93ded097434\", \"lookId\": \"look-default\"}], \"assetBindingMode\": \"stable\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"locationId\": \"loc-52e78f37adb8\", \"propIds\": [], \"propNames\": [], \"durationSec\": 6, \"compiledPrompt\": \"\", \"jobId\": null, \"status\": \"idle\", \"outputVideoUrl\": null, \"progress\": 0, \"takes\": [], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": null, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"严肃的语气，轻微的环境音\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Serious tone, subtle ambient sounds\", \"timingNote\": \"对白长度适中，原时长 5s 调整为 6s，增强情绪张力。\"}]}, {\"id\": \"scene-ee327731208f\", \"sceneNumber\": 8, \"title\": \"藏经阁的泪水\", \"description\": \"李元婴和灵儿站在藏经阁前，灵儿眼中闪烁泪光，轻声表达内心。\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗藏经阁\", \"shots\": [{\"id\": \"shot-2ac019ab3c98\", \"shotNumber\": 11, \"title\": \"灵儿的情感倾诉\", \"description\": \"李元婴和灵儿站在藏经阁前，灵儿眼中闪烁泪光，轻声表达内心。\", \"promptText\": \"[Shot 11] Two figures facing each other in front of a grand library, emotional storytelling with dramatic lighting. At 00:00.000, Ling\'er speaks softly: <d>[Chinese] 原来，我一直在寻找的，就是你。灵石，不过是一个开始……</d> At 00:03.000, Li Yuanying responds: <d>[Chinese] 灵儿，我……</d>\", \"dialogue\": \"灵儿: （轻声）原来，我一直在寻找的，就是你。灵石，不过是一个开始…… 李元婴: （感动）灵儿，我……\", \"characterNames\": [\"灵儿\", \"李元婴\"], \"characterBindings\": [{\"characterId\": \"char-f93ded097434\", \"lookId\": \"look-default\"}], \"assetBindingMode\": \"stable\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗藏经阁\", \"locationId\": \"loc-ccdfedb400f0\", \"propIds\": [], \"propNames\": [], \"durationSec\": 5, \"compiledPrompt\": \"\", \"jobId\": null, \"status\": \"idle\", \"outputVideoUrl\": null, \"progress\": 0, \"takes\": [], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": null, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"轻柔的风声，低语的情感\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Gentle wind, heartfelt whisper\", \"timingNote\": \"情感对白，维持原时长 5s，突出情感氛围。\"}]}, {\"id\": \"scene-becd2ef827a6\", \"sceneNumber\": 9, \"title\": \"演武场的重逢\", \"description\": \"李元婴和灵儿相视而笑，宗门长老欣慰，暗示未来。\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"shots\": [{\"id\": \"shot-af8171afe7e8\", \"shotNumber\": 12, \"title\": \"结局的对话\", \"description\": \"李元婴和灵儿相视而笑，宗门长老欣慰，暗示未来。\", \"promptText\": \"[Shot 12] Two cultivators smiling at each other in a martial arena, ending with a sense of closure. Cinematic composition. At 00:00.000, the Elder smiles欣慰ly. At 00:01.500, the Elder says: <d>[Chinese] 缘分已定，未来可期。</d> At 00:03.000, Li Yuanying speaks to Ling\'er: <d>[Chinese] 灵儿，我们……</d> At 00:05.000, Ling\'er responds with a smile: <d>[Chinese] 我们，继续走我们的路吧。</d>\", \"dialogue\": \"长老: （欣慰）缘分已定，未来可期。 李元婴: （对灵儿）灵儿，我们…… 灵儿: （微笑）我们，继续走我们的路吧。\", \"characterNames\": [\"灵儿\", \"宗门长老\", \"李元婴\"], \"characterBindings\": [{\"characterId\": \"char-f93ded097434\", \"lookId\": \"look-default\"}], \"assetBindingMode\": \"stable\", \"locationName\": \"云海仙宗演武场\", \"locationId\": \"loc-52e78f37adb8\", \"propIds\": [], \"propNames\": [], \"durationSec\": 6, \"compiledPrompt\": \"\", \"jobId\": null, \"status\": \"idle\", \"outputVideoUrl\": null, \"progress\": 0, \"takes\": [], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": null, \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"轻快的脚步声，温馨的笑语\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Light footsteps, warm laughter\", \"timingNote\": \"对白较多，原时长 5s 调整为 6s，确保结局的温馨感。\"}]}], \"agentStatus\": [{\"id\": \"research\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"无事实核查需求，已跳过\"}, {\"id\": \"script\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"剧本已写好\"}, {\"id\": \"art_style\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"画风已选定\"}, {\"id\": \"storyboard\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"已写出 12 个镜头\"}, {\"id\": \"characters\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"人物方案已抽出，定妆图待生成\"}, {\"id\": \"locations\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"场景方案已抽出，定妆图待生成\"}, {\"id\": \"voice\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"配音方案已写好，音频待生成\"}, {\"id\": \"music\", \"status\": \"completed\", \"error\": null, \"message\": \"配乐方案已写好，音