dAt\": \"2026-09-01T06:52:38.812540+00:00\", \"promptSnapshot\": \"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Enchanted fantasy 3D render, magical atmosphere, glowing details, rich textures, whimsical lighting. A medium shot at eye-level frames Han Yuping\'s fading form on a mountain peak, with Han Ling looking on tearfully. Han Yuping smiles softly as golden light surrounds her body, which gradually dissipates into smoke. The camera holds a static shot for emotional effect, then slowly fades out over 5 seconds. Han Yuping (S1) says: <d>[Chinese] 师弟，修仙路上...孤独是常态，唯有...守住本心，方得始终...</d>.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Soft wind, light rain, and faint sighing sounds.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\", \"renderPass\": \"final\", \"workflowId\": null, \"videoWorkflowFamily\": null, \"options\": {}}], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"smooth\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \"stillStatus\": null, \"usePreviousEndFrame\": false, \"approvedTakeId\": \"88mCPT5hfiVm\", \"activeTakeIndex\": 0, \"speakerName\": null, \"voiceId\": null, \"ttsStatus\": \"idle\", \"ttsUrl\": null, \"ttsPath\": null, \"ttsError\": null, \"soundscape\": \"风声、雨声和虚弱的叹息声\", \"soundscapeEn\": \"Soft wind, light rain, and faint sighing sounds.\"}, {\"id\": \"shot-b984671dadaf\", \"shotNumber\": 12, \"title\": \"韩立哭泣\", \"description\": \"韩立跪地痛哭，手中持有残破玉简。\", \"promptText\": \"Enchanted fantasy 3D render, a close-up of Han Ling kneeling, crying silently while holding a残破玉简. The mountain peak is dimly lit. Camera pushes in to focus on the玉简\'s glow. No dialogue.\", \"dialogue\": \"\", \"characterNames\": [\"韩立\"], \"characterBindings\": [{\"characterId\": \"char-1b250ba26e41\", \"lookId\": \"look-default\"}], \"assetBindingMode\