今...学生必不会辱没此等恩情...</d>. The camera then pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Whispering wind, faint humming from the玉简, and nostalgic ambient sounds create a serene yet reflective atmosphere.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\", \"renderPass\": \"preview\", \"workflowId\": null, \"videoWorkflowFamily\": null, \"options\": {}}, {\"id\": \"7dxZc7GBSinL\", \"takeNumber\": 2, \"jobId\": \"7dxZc7GBSinL\", \"videoUrl\": \"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/minimax_h3/20260901/125906_a1921dbcf867d7a3.mp4\", \"coverUrl\": null, \"outputPath\": null, \"status\": \"succeeded\", \"progress\": 100, \"error\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-01T04:44:11.233195+00:00\", \"promptSnapshot\": \"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] at 00:00.000, the camera is static, medium shot at eye-level, capturing an enchanted fantasy 3D render with magical atmosphere, glowing details, rich textures, and whimsical lighting. A lone figure of Han Ling stands on a mountain peak, holding a残破玉简 that glows faintly. He looks up at the sky with a thoughtful expression. As he casts《敛天术》, a flash of memory briefly shows Han Yuping\'s smiling face. The camera slowly rotates with small amplitude at slow speed to emphasize the glow, and then pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed toward Han Ling\'s face. Han Ling speaks: <d>[Chinese] 雨萍师姐...您当年用生命护我，如今...学生必不会辱没此等恩情...</d>.\\n\\noverall_soundscape: Whispering wind, faint humming from the玉简, and nostalgic ambient sounds.\\n\\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\", \"renderPass\": \"final\", \"workflowId\": null, \"videoWorkflowFamily\": null, \"options\": {}}], \"camera\": {\"scale\": \"MS\", \"movement\": \"zoom_in\", \"angle\": \"eye_level\", \"speed\": \"slow\", \"lighting\": \"cinematic_soft\", \"sfx\": \"\"}, \"error\": null, \"firstFrameUrl\": null, \"firstFramePath\": null, \"firstFrameJobId\": null, \"endFrameUrl\": null, \"endFramePath\": null, \"endFrameJobId\": null, \"stillUrl\": null, \"stillJobId\": null, \