事）玉牌的事，你永远不会知道。\\n\\n黑衣执事：（银戒闪过寒光）来不及了...\\n\\n【内·藏锋石窟·夜】\\n石门完全闭合，玉牌依然亮着微光。\\n\\n陆沉舟：（查看玉牌）我们不该回宗门了，这里藏着比玉牌更重要的秘密。\\n\\n叶清璃：（点头）走，往深处去。那家伙不会轻易放过我们。\"}, \"artStyle\": {\"id\": \"as_1007\", \"name\": \"超写实漫画融合\", \"name_en\": \"Hyperreal Manga Fusion\", \"promptPrefix\": \"hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting\", \"imageUrl\": \"/api/director/art-styles/as_1007/preview\"}, \"characters\": [{\"id\": \"char-wuling-luchen\", \"name\": \"陆沉舟\", \"description\": \"二十岁左右的外门采药弟子。半束黑发，深青短斗篷左肩有一道固定旧破口，墨色窄袖衣被暴雨逐镜打湿；左腰系青铜药匣，右手常以两指夹符或攥住玉牌。性格克制警惕。\", \"promptText\": \"young Chinese male cultivator, early twenties, calm narrow eyes, half-tied black hair, deep teal short cloak with one fixed tear on the left shoulder, dark narrow-sleeved robe, aged bronze medicine case tied at the left waist, rain-soaked but consistent costume, restrained alert expression, stylized Chinese fantasy animation\", \"role\": \"外门采药弟子／主角\", \"gender\": \"male\", \"type\": \"character\", \"identitySpec\": {\"ageRange\": \"20-23\", \"regionalAppearance\": \"Chinese\", \"faceFeatures\": \"清瘦、直鼻、警惕的窄眼\", \"hair\": \"半束黑发，鬓角被雨打湿\", \"skinTone\": \"雨夜冷白但有自然肤色\", \"bodyBuild\": \"清瘦结实\", \"distinguishingMarks\": \"左肩斗篷旧破口\", \"immutableAccessories\": \"左腰青铜药匣\", \"avoidChanges\": \"不得改变年龄、发型、斗篷颜色或药匣位置\"}, \"specStatus\": \"approved\", \"aiAssumptions\": [], \"portrait\": {\"versions\": [{\"id\": \"assetv-yUv6n1PqOGg\", \"jobId\": \"c2PpC02pMX9S\", \"imageUrl\": \"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260903/102206_260773e0d68e21fa.png\", \"status\": \"succeeded\", \"promptSnapshot\": \"hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. single production identity portrait of one character, head and shoulders, front-facing with a slight three-quarter turn, neutral expression, eyes clearly visible, even studio lighting, plain mid-gray background, centered, no text, no c