INSERT INTO `job_rounds` VALUES ('0014bfc3-72dc-4a4c-9d2c-eecb9fd892b6','fX3hCFk9sNd1',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从低角度仰拍缓缓上移，旗子高高扬起，狐狸前爪挥动令旗，口中清晰开合发出口令，随即后腿微屈蓄力前倾，身体顺势向前推进；背景林木虚化为色块光斑，画面最终定格在令旗划出的半圆轨迹末端，锁定赛道起点线。远处传来清脆的发令枪声回响。 Says: 预备，开始！','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"steps\": 8, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 5, \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"steps\": 8}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164921_d71dcc7883620481.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164921_792517ba3d753c5c.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-28T07:14:09.619734+00:00','2026-08-28T07:17:42.520743+00:00','2026-08-28T07:17:42.519747+00:00',210994),('00714069-7f4b-463f-896e-c6c05d46587c','dkiHfbsa3oHs',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE reverse-angle establishing image of the SAME outdoor location.\n\nStand where the front master camera stood, then yaw-rotate 180 degrees to face the back side / opposite side of the location.\nThe two views are the SAME location at the SAME moment.\n\nINPUT IMAGE:\n- REFERENCE 1 = the FRONT-FACING master of this location.\n- It covers front center plus roughly half of left and right. It does NOT show the back-facing half.\n- You are showing what is BEHIND REFERENCE 1\'s camera after a 180-degree yaw.\n- Do NOT copy REFERENCE 1\'s front-center composition.\n\nSTYLE SOURCE:\n- Visual style comes ENTIRELY from REFERENCE 1 (the front master). Match its art style, materials, palette, lighting and exposure. Do not re-derive style from text.\n\nSCENE NAME: 骊珠洞天\nSCENE TYPE: exterior\nSCENE DESCRIPTION:\n一个即将崩塌的神秘洞天，周围是小镇和百姓，环境险峻，危机四伏。\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n- Eye-level horizon, wide ~160-180° coverage: back center plus half of left and right.\n- Camera faces the back side / opposite side of the location (SCENE DESCRIPTION 背面 / back / 后).\n- If the text says \"背面是 X\", X is the focal content of this image.\n- The front-facing subject of the master is now behind the camera and should not dominate this frame.\n\nREQUIRED EDGE OVERLAP:\n- Reverse LEFT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s RIGHT edge.\n- Reverse RIGHT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s LEFT edge.\n\nCENTER REGION:\n- Show what is behind the master\'s camera. Fill from 背面 notes. Do not invent objects absent from text and master.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- Eye-level wide rectilinear perspective. NO fisheye, NO equirectangular panorama, NO 360 unwrap, NO floorplan, NO collage.\n- 16:9 aspect ratio. One finished establishing image.\n- No people, no readable text, labels, or watermarks.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\dkiHfbsa3oHs\\\\1_M4Uqfc8pxydz.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-04T02:44:49.710039+00:00','2026-09-04T02:45:58.843085+00:00','2026-09-04T02:45:58.840752+00:00',NULL),('008f7186-f451-404d-8c1d-198f969cf4d5','1fDCtJw0zMjd',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','failed','图片生成失败',28,'ROLE: You are a MASTER FILM DIRECTOR and storyboard artist. TASK: Draw ONE panel as a rushed film director storyboard scribble on cheap white paper. This is a blocking thumbnail, not a finished illustration. STYLE: loose pencil/marker doodle, imperfect strokes, deliberately unpolished, raw thumbnail-grade draft. Completely uninterested in artistic finish. WHITE PAPER BACKGROUND ONLY. No photographic production still, no cinematic lighting, no grayscale rendering, no gradients, no shadows, no material shading, no texture, no digital art, no vector clean-up. SYMBOLIC STORYBOARD PEOPLE ONLY: oval head, one spine line, single-stroke arms/legs, tiny facing ticks. NO clothing, no hair, no facial features, no skin, no realistic anatomy. SINGLE-MOMENT RULE: exactly one camera setup and one frozen story moment. No collage, split-screen, subtitles, watermark, or readable text. If a scene reference is attached, redraw it as sparse black/gray line art only. Do NOT copy realistic lighting, colors, texture, or rendered detail. World/setting cue only (do not render as a finished still). Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. CHARACTER COLOR MARKERS: 刺客 = solid INDIGO fill #4F46E5 featureless mannequin. named prop 暗器链子: simple silhouette / marker shape, no material finish. ACTION (source of truth): 落地时无声响。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]','内容未通过审核（可能含真人等受限内容）：我可以帮你生成这张分镜草图，但当前请求中没有提供可用于参考/编辑的原始图片目标。请上传需要参考的图片（如果有），我会基于它重新绘制；如果没有参考图，也可以直接告诉我，我将按你提供的文字设定生成。','2026-09-02T09:21:23.334057+00:00','2026-09-02T09:22:19.368928+00:00','2026-09-02T09:22:19.366511+00:00',NULL),('00b093b3-2b57-4a41-a132-bccecb894900','2xh9YsAUkmQM',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the character same young Chinese male cultivator, deep teal rain cloak with fixed left-shoulder tear, dark narrow-sleeved robe, bronze medicine case on left waist, rain-wet hair shown in <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is the scene abandoned rain-soaked herb garden overgrown with vines, half-buried stone stele with a fresh cinnabar handprint at front center, cracked low wall behind it, dark cave entrance at back right, fixed muddy puddles and broken herb racks, stylized Chinese fantasy animation shown in <Picture 2>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video uses <Subject 1>, <Subject 2> as its referenced visible elements while playing the described actions, camera moves, and diegetic sound.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a medium shot at eye-level frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: Steward has stepped forward, rain continues. 陆沉舟, wearing a deep blue short cloak with a left shoulder tear, pretends to hand over the jade plaque while secretly attaching a talisman. At 00:03.000, he says: <d>[Chinese] 这是你说的玉牌。</d> The camera pans slightly with medium amplitude. End at 00:06.000. End this clip on: Luchen has handed the jade plaque and attached a talisman, rain persists\n\noverall_soundscape:\nRain sound, subtle footsteps\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 8.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 8}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\2xh9YsAUkmQM\\\\1_c2PpC02pMX9S.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\2xh9YsAUkmQM\\\\2_4in6zSfWKj.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-07T14:05:57.602309+00:00','2026-09-07T14:18:34.514061+00:00','2026-09-07T14:18: