gs and percussion, tempo 120 BPM, dynamic shifts from soft intro to intense crescendo for suspense.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\jVkjQ1IY6LJ\\\\1_Li6AsIH0zHrg.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\jVkjQ1IY6LJ\\\\2_eTxTR7AyY8Yi.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\jVkjQ1IY6LJ\\\\3_i8U5w2e7wi8.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-01T17:50:55.554023+00:00','2026-09-01T18:41:22.821668+00:00','2026-09-01T18:41:22.821166+00:00',627005),('01ffed6f-2a76-450b-949e-cf620e5e1ab8','QmyZRKSQahRQ',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the character A tired 28-year-old male programmer with glasses, working late at night in an office shown in <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is the scene A dimly lit office at night, the only light coming from a computer monitor, empty coffee cups and programming books scattered on the desk, shown in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> is the scene empty establishing shot of 公司会议室, no people, cinematic environment shown in <Picture 3>.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] The target video is a short 5-second scene featuring <Subject 1> in <Subject 2>, with an establishing shot of <Subject 3>, focusing on his exhaustion and typing, set in a dimly lit office at night.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the tired male programmer with glasses, screen-bound interface, placement, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a hyperreal manga fusion style with realistic world and stylized anime energy, featuring expressive faces and clean dramatic lighting. [Shot 1] A medium shot begins focusing on <Subject 1>, a tired 28-year-old male programmer with glasses, sitting in front of a computer screen reflecting code. <Subject 2> is visible in the background, with dim lighting, empty coffee cups, and programming books on the desk. <Subject 3> provides an empty establishing shot of a company meeting room, shown briefly in the corner. Action: <Subject 1> rubs his eyes, continues typing on the keyboard, and the camera slowly pushes in with a small amplitude at a slow speed to emphasize his exhaustion. No dialogue is present. Camera: Static at eye level with slight dramatic lighting highlighting the dim atmosphere.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe sound includes the steady noise of keyboard typing and the low hum of a computer fan in a quiet, late-night office setting.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA subtle electronic atmosphere score with a slow tempo and restrained instrumentation, enhancing the late-night mood without overpowering the scene.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"steps\": 4, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"fast\", \"weight_profile\": \