e target video uses <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, <Subject 3>, <Subject 4>, <Subject 5>, <Subject 6> as its referenced visible elements and the supplied keyframes while playing the described actions, camera moves, and diegetic sound.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, subjects, and lighting remain the starting state of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 6> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a close-up at eye-level frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: 承接水面三道倒影与第三道黑影的左手。. Start state: the three reflections remain in shallow water. Push slowly toward the third reflection\'s left hand, then lift to the actual engraved silver ring; its pattern exactly matches the recessed ritual socket on the left wall. Lu stays screen left holding jade in his right hand; Ye remains screen right with sword guarding the door seam. One visible change: Lu\'s eyeline travels from the ring to the ritual socket and his right hand closes around the bronze case. End state: his eyes fix on the left-wall socket, medicine case held ready at his left waist. End this clip on: 陆沉舟目光锁定左壁阵眼