op small pale green jade token with one diagonal crack, rain-wet surface, intermittent faint warm amber glow from the crack, no lettering; same crack and scale throughout shown in <Picture 7>.\n<Subject 7> is the prop narrow yellow talisman paper with dark cinnabar strokes; continuity state progresses only from dry paper to rain-wet attached paper to center-burning paper to red-edged ash ribbon shown in <Picture 8>.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video uses <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, <Subject 3>, <Subject 4>, <Subject 5>, <Subject 6>, <Subject 7> as its referenced visible elements and the supplied keyframes while playing the described actions, camera moves, and diegetic sound.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, subjects, and lighting remain the starting state of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 6> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 7> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a wide shot at low-angle frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: 从上一镜洞内浅水反光开始。. Start state: continue from the shallow-water reflection just inside the cave. Low angle follows Lu\'s and Ye\'s wet boots entering: Lu remains left, Ye remains right. Rain sound is swallowed by the cave, leaving dripping water. Reveal the recessed ritual socket on the left wall, half-closing patterned stone gate ahead, and dark passage to the right. One visible change: the water settles and shows three reflections; the third black reflection stops outside the door. End state: all three reflections remain in the water, with the black one separated by the door line. End this clip on: 水面稳定映出三道身影，第三道黑影隔在门外。. The camera follows with a tracking shot with small amplitude at slow speed. The shot begins from <Picture 1>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nfootsteps in water, cave drips\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n低频箫与极轻鼓点；前两场被雨声覆盖，石门合上后只留一条低音持续。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\qQr7IU5qV8PN\\\\1_c2PpC02pMX9S.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\qQr7IU5qV8PN\\\\2_CMEZSiqc4V1n.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\qQr7IU5qV8PN\\\\3_dJ5dsnWjjbjZ.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\qQr7IU5qV8PN\\\\4_YEvcRvmSWFM.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\qQr7IU5qV8PN\\\\5_6bVCWTsxou5.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\qQr7IU5