lude multiple characters.\n- No text, labels, or panel numbers on the image\n- Do NOT create beauty-retouched, glamorized, cosmetic-ad, or fashion-editorial output\n- Keep the project style consistent across all 4 panels','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\LAkFpHbSWzpy\\\\1_8uN8MfEhSzkm.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-08T03:14:33.935394+00:00','2026-09-08T03:15:38.126655+00:00','2026-09-08T03:15:38.124324+00:00',NULL),('0ef6fb1e-ddf5-46cd-ae3c-40d986ffdfd8','XBcpSGpjytG',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-t2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Enchanted fantasy 3D render, magical atmosphere, glowing details, rich textures, whimsical lighting. A medium shot frames Han Yuping and Han Ling standing on a mountain peak. The camera holds static initially, then slowly tilts down with small amplitude at slow speed to emphasize the浮现ing淡金色符文 on Han Yuping\'s hand. Han Yuping speaks calmly with a voice echoing slightly in the mystical environment: <d>韩雨萍：你可知道，这世上最锋利的刀，往往不是别人手中的剑，而是你内心的执念。收敛自身，方能洞见天地至理。</d> Han Ling listens respectfully as Han Yuping\'s fingers lightly dance, bringing the淡金色符文 to life. The camera then pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed to focus on the symbol.\n\noverall_soundscape: Wind sounds and soft rain, with subtle humming from the magical符文.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"steps\": 4, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_fl2v_lightx2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfy.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_