ERENCE 1 (the front master). Match its art style, materials, palette, lighting and exposure. Do not re-derive style from text. Keep the reverse view EMPTY of people.\n\nSCENE NAME: 塾中\nSCENE TYPE: interior\nSCENE DESCRIPTION (environment notes only; ignore people and story action):\n破旧学堂，土墙木窗，简陋书案，蒙尘卷轴，窗边隐约可见偷听少年身影，朗朗书声与蝉鸣交织。\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n- Eye-level horizon, wide ~160-180° coverage: back center plus half of left and right.\n- Camera faces the back wall (SCENE DESCRIPTION 背面 / back / 后).\n- If the text says \"背面是 X\", X is the focal content of this image.\n- The front-facing subject of the master is now behind the camera and should not dominate this frame.\n\nREQUIRED EDGE OVERLAP:\n- Reverse LEFT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s RIGHT edge.\n- Reverse RIGHT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s LEFT edge.\n\nCENTER REGION:\n- Show what is behind the master\'s camera. Fill from 背面 notes. Do not invent objects absent from text and master.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- Eye-level wide rectilinear perspective. NO fisheye, NO equirectangular panorama, NO 360 unwrap, NO floorplan, NO collage.\n- 16:9 aspect ratio. One finished establishing image.\n\nEMPTY LOCATION CONTRACT:\n- Output an unoccupied set, as if photographed before actors arrive.\n- SCENE DESCRIPTION may mention character names or story action (跪、站、坐、咳血、议论). Those are NOTES, not subjects.\n- Do NOT draw any person, face, body, silhouette, crowd, corpse, ghost, or character occupying the space.\n- Keep only architecture and fixed dressings that remain after people leave (walls, floor, ceiling, bed, window, furniture, lamps).\n- Do not turn the frame into a story beat, portrait, or fashion shot.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- No people, no characters, no temporary story props.\n- Preserve only fixed environment objects: walls, floor, ceiling, doors, windows,\n  counters, tables, seats, shelves, lamps, appliances, architectural trim, exterior fixtures.\n- No readable text, labels, UI, watermarks, collage, floorplan, or diagrams.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\URhgTyn3W6mM\\\\1_syzKjFs4uFuy.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-07T07:10:17.409186+00:00','2026-09-07T07:13:08.612599+00:00','2026-09-07T07:13:05.821240+00:00',NULL),('1426c406-94cd-444a-a7d4-4a5209db0e9c','fziYSreMiKNI',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'cinematic still in 写实古装剧 visual style. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description.. single production identity portrait of one character, head and shoulders, front-facing with a slight three-quarter turn, neutral expression, eyes clearly visible, even studio lighting, plain mid-gray background, centered, no text, no collage, no duplicate person, no dramatic pose. 男性，中年，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，小麦肤色，方脸. 魁梧. 暗中保护主角的修行者，性格温和，实力深厚。. 齐静春','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"1:1\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"1:1\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-01T06:47:30.458861+00:00','2026-09-01T06:52:10.230455+00:00','2026-09-01T06:52:10.175442+00:00',NULL),('14b438d8-0b3d-4b03-9f19-a3293288f357','QV3qJG4fU4Cn',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> is the character same young Chinese male cultivator, deep teal rain cloak with fixed left-shoulder tear, dark narrow-sleeved robe, bronze medicine case on left waist, rain-wet hair shown in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 2> is the scene night rain on a narrow cliffside wooden boardwalk, wet black rock wall on the left, mist-filled abyss on the right, distant