dow, furniture, lamps).\n- Do not turn the frame into a story beat, portrait, or fashion shot.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- No people, no characters, no temporary story props.\n- Preserve only fixed environment objects: walls, floor, ceiling, doors, windows,\n  counters, tables, seats, shelves, lamps, appliances, architectural trim, exterior fixtures.\n- No readable text, labels, UI, watermarks, collage, floorplan, or diagrams.\n- FRONT-FACING HALF ONLY.\n- Output one finished scene reference image only.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-07T09:51:12.953895+00:00','2026-09-07T09:52:55.485418+00:00','2026-09-07T09:52:55.482926+00:00',NULL),('3430222d-1f7d-4232-a736-aa28b035bac9','xG7ygNMI4Y',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从低角度仰拍缓缓上移，旗子高高扬起，狐狸前爪挥动令旗，口中清晰开合发出口令，随即后腿微屈蓄力前倾，身体顺势向前推进；背景林木虚化为色块光斑，画面最终定格在令旗划出的半圆轨迹末端，锁定赛道起点线。远处传来清脆的发令枪声回响。 Says: 预备，开始！','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"steps\": 8, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 5, \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"steps\": 8}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164846_5d38914c3f7bff57.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-28T03:26:26.090476+00:00','2026-08-28T03:29:36.025580+00:00','2026-08-28T03:29:36.024581+00:00',187865),('34f08c46-fcd9-4fe5-ad7a-93c83feb0092','MXOCllDCg9o7',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> is the character same young Chinese male cult