er at 0.00 seconds; lock composition, camera position, and blocking. The camera starts from a ground-level perspective, slowly rises to chest height, and then stabilizes. The mother sits on the edge of the bed, coughing weakly, blood trickling from her lips. Her face is pale, and her hand covers her chest. Chen Ping\'an kneels in front of the bed, his head lowered with sadness, and his tightly held pottery jar trembles slightly. The old curtains are blown by the wind, and slivers of light filter through the window, casting斑驳的光影 on the floor. Outside the window, the sound of rain and vague figures whispering in the distance create a压抑的氛围.\n\nUse <Picture 2> as the character portrait still of Chen Ping\'an; lock his face and identity only, do not change the blocking or composition of the first frame.\n\nUse <Picture 3> as the costume still of Chen Ping\'an named 基础造型; lock his clothing and posture only, do not affect the composition of the first frame.\n\nUse <Picture 4> as the front environment plate of 破屋内; lock the space and lighting only, do not change the blocking of the characters in the first frame.\n\nStart the shot from the exact composition of <Picture 1>, maintain the camera position. The light from the window illuminates Chen Ping\'an and his mother. Her cough gradually intensifies, her body leaning forward slightly, and her clothing flies with each cough. Chen Ping\'an\'s shoulders tremble slightly, his eyes reflecting sadness, tightly holding the pottery jar. The wind blows the curtains, and light streaks through the window, creating a fragmented光影 on the floor. Outside, the sound of rain and indistinct figures whispering create a压抑的氛围. The camera remains stable, focusing on Chen Ping\'an and his mother, with the light gradually fading to create a somber mood.\n\nTransition to a new camera angle: the camera slowly rises from Chen Ping\'an\'s frontal view to an overhead perspective, showcasing the entire room environment. The cracked walls, old furniture, and worn-out roof are clearly visible. Light from the window casts strong shadows, creating a stark contrast on the bed. Mother\'s cough becomes more intense, her clothing fluttering with each cough. Chen Ping\'an\'s gaze becomes more resolute, and he grips the pottery jar tightly, preparing to stand. Outside, the sound of rain softens, but the camera remains stable, with the light gradually softening.\n\nMaintain the camera steady: switch to a profile shot of the mother, slowly lowering the camera to focus on her face. Her lips tremble slightly, eyes half-closed, breathing becomes rapid. Chen Ping\'an gently places his hands on her back, showing comfort. Light from the window illuminates her face, while her weakness is subtly highlighted. Outside the window, the sound of rain gets closer again, but the camera stays stable, focusing entirely on the mother and Chen Ping\'an.\n\nSlowly rise the camera: from the mother\'s profile shot, the camera moves upward through the room, revealing the entire environment. The worn-out roof and distant rain outside the window are clearly visible, with indistinct figures whispering in the background. Light gradually fades, maintaining a somber mood. Chen Ping\'an and his mother\'s figures become more blurred, and the shot ends in complete darkness.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.2\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 10.0, \"speed\": \"balanced\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"steps\": 8, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"duration\": 10.0, \"quality\": \"0.2\", \"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"speed\": \"balanced\"}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\sKXTPkC3uov5\\\\1_UaXn4O2AJWiT.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\