MENTS:\n- Eye-level wide rectilinear perspective. NO fisheye, NO equirectangular panorama, NO 360 unwrap, NO floorplan, NO collage.\n- 16:9 aspect ratio. One finished establishing image.\n- No people, no readable text, labels, or watermarks.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\MsadH5pNCPL4\\\\1_9OjIDmOpPQkP.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-03T02:47:41.114860+00:00','2026-09-03T02:48:51.515517+00:00','2026-09-03T02:48:51.513391+00:00',NULL),('6e254aa4-f4ce-4db0-85dd-789f3f1ca2a3','GGD0CrxcOfME',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'ROLE: You are a MASTER FILM DIRECTOR and storyboard artist. TASK: Draw ONE panel as a rushed film director storyboard scribble on cheap white paper. This is a blocking thumbnail, not a finished illustration. STYLE: loose pencil/marker doodle, imperfect strokes, deliberately unpolished, raw thumbnail-grade draft. Completely uninterested in artistic finish. WHITE PAPER BACKGROUND ONLY. No photographic production still, no cinematic lighting, no grayscale rendering, no gradients, no shadows, no material shading, no texture, no digital art, no vector clean-up. SYMBOLIC STORYBOARD PEOPLE ONLY: oval head, one spine line, single-stroke arms/legs, tiny facing ticks. NO clothing, no hair, no facial features, no skin, no realistic anatomy. SINGLE-MOMENT RULE: exactly one camera setup and one frozen story moment. No collage, split-screen, subtitles, watermark, or readable text. If a scene reference is attached, redraw it as sparse black/gray line art only. Do NOT copy realistic lighting, colors, texture, or rendered detail. World/setting cue only (do not render as a finished still). Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. CHARACTER COLOR MARKERS: 齐静春 = solid VIOLET fill #7C3AED featureless mannequin; 陈平安 = solid AMBER fill #D97706 featureless mannequin. location 骊珠洞天: simplified architectural line art only. 一个即将崩塌的神秘洞天，周围是小镇和百姓，环境险峻，危机四伏。. ACTION (source of truth): 骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗. speaking, gesture only, no readable text: 骊珠洞天即将崩塌，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人 殉道身陨，临终留下机缘与遗愿。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\GGD0CrxcOfME\\\\1_M4Uqfc8pxydz.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-04T02:47:39.260354+00:00','2026-09-04T02:48:43.899992+00:00','2026-09-04T02:48:43.893831+00:00',NULL),('6e9f92c7-ce9c-4212-ada3-d4d08a8c24b6','orASJOo3NYi0',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从高处缓缓下摇，掠过树冠间的晨光，逐渐聚焦到林间空地的起跑线。一只背着深绿甲壳的乌龟静伏在起点，身旁一道灰白条纹皮毛的兔子微微屈膝，前爪轻点地面，远处棕红短毛的狐狸立于裁判石旁举起发令旗。相机继续前移，穿过飘浮的尘粒，最终停驻在赛道表面的苔藓纹理上，风拂动草尖，两道身影蓄势待发。远处传来鸟鸣声，树叶沙沙作响。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"quality\": \"0.2\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 5, \"megapixels\": 0.2}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164812_cc54f1589975b273.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-25T06:11:32.569249+00:00','2026-08-25T06:26:05.111185+00:00',NULL,NULL),('6f1bb4d2-4382-4501-944f-f703efb7d357','wsrUSqugqWg4',1,'minimax-h3-t2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium shot at eye-level frames the ancient cultivation ground. Dramatic lighting casts long shadows, and rich atmosphere fills the scene with emotional visual storytelling. At 00:00.000, 同门甲 and other disciples approach Li Yuanying, their eyes filled with envy. At 00:01.500, 同门甲 speaks: <d>[Chinese] 李元婴，那灵石从哪里来的？</d> At 00:03.000, Li Yuanying replies: <d>[Chinese] 藏经阁后山，我不过是运气好罢了。</d> At 00:05.000, the camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as Li Yuanying微微一笑, capturing the tense atmosphere among the disciples.\n\noverall_soundscape: Footsteps and chatter with underlying tension, the sound of rustling robes and the faint hum of the glowing stone.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Orchestral score with strings and brass, tempo varying from moderate to fast, dynamics shifting from soft to loud with dramatic swells.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 1.0, \"duration\": 6.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 6}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-01T11:19:07.524342+00:00','2026-09-01T12:05:09.225261+00:00','2026-09-01T12:05:09.224762+00:00',2757261),('6f54471d-82d7-43fb-b5b8-1023aeb57162','81DDOSzEAgy3',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','failed','图片生成失败',58,'Render this sketch into a high-quality colored production still. Image 1 / SKETCH IS the base drawing — preserve ALL composition, crop, poses, and camera angles exactly. Other reference images lock identity only and must not change the sketch layout. After the sketch, character attachments are FACE then COSTUME for each named character in order. FACE locks identity; COSTUME locks clothing. Do not treat a costume sheet as the face. CRITICAL: Keep exact composition from sketch. Only add color, texture, and lighting. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k. CHARACTERS (match face references): 齐静春 (sketch marker VIOLET #7C3AED) 男性，middle，黑色短发，灰色眼睛，中等肤色，方脸; 陈平安 (sketch marker AMBER #D