eserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained throughout the video.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video adopts a cinematic ad style with high contrast lighting and a clean, readable composition. [Shot 1] begins with a close-up on <Subject 1>, the luxury car owner wearing branded casual wear and sunglasses, hands in pockets. At 00:00.000, the camera holds steady as <Subject 1> speaks calmly. At 00:01.000, subtle hand gestures indicate business. The luxury car owner (阿杰) says: <d>我已经联系了保险公司，损失不大，只是…</d>. At 00:02.000, the camera pushes in slowly with a small amplitude, maintaining focus on <Subject 1>\'s expression as they imply a more serious issue. The shot ends with <Subject 1> looking directly at the camera, suggesting unresolved tension.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe soundscape features calm, clear dialogue with a subtle background of sirens or urban noise to enhance the suspenseful atmosphere.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nSynthwave with strings and percussion, tempo 120 BPM, dynamic shifts from soft intro to intense crescendo for suspense.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\ttsyTqgBhS6H\\\\1_eTxTR7AyY8Yi.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-01T18:07:33.406657+00:00','2026-09-01T20:25:32.529195+00:00','2026-09-01T20:25:32.528697+00:00',480758),('7f9c6ebc-c805-464a-88a0-af5146d68c3e','ApkmbEMtBNEn',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'high CTR ad creative, bold subject, clean readable composition, vibrant lighting, s