IREMENTS:\n- NO people, hands, fingers, or living creatures\n- Object only, isolated on clean background\n- No readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n- No labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, or signatures\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"1:1\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"1:1\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-01T08:41:35.781663+00:00','2026-09-01T08:42:25.383633+00:00','2026-09-01T08:42:25.329642+00:00',NULL),('7M1WVEN7OFWt:round:1','7M1WVEN7OFWt',1,'vace-video','video','failed','生成失败',0,'实拍文艺近景，女生站在驿站门口，纤长指尖轻触透明 AR 眼镜镜框@图1 ，镜片浮动细碎金色诗词光粒，背景虚化青瓦古巷与枝叶，清新治愈质感，画面干净无多余人群，浅景深，焦点落在眼镜。镜头柔和快速向前推进，丝滑柔化快推运镜，镜头穿透一侧的AR眼镜镜片，镜面流淌淡金色粒子特效转场，外部实景缓慢虚化褪去，朦胧水墨光斑过渡画面，轻薄数字光效，随后视线进入眼镜内部幻境空间，白帝城鸟瞰图@图2 ，叠加轻薄鎏金 AR 特效，AR特效缓飘动，镜头慢慢摇起，远景@图3 ，定格。','',NULL,'{}','{}',0,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164749_835c7bf1645ee8d4.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164752_f0eec4b1f50c1f6b.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164757_ee0d802eedf0c461.png\"]','HTTPConnectionPool(host=\'127.0.0.1\', port=8188): Read timed out. (read timeout=30)','2026-07-17T04:37:40.317364+00:00','2026-08-11T07:23:35.869024+00:00',NULL,NULL),('81bdedb8-86aa-4f1a-9f66-828fc5bb9058','Uo0SWUiTACJu',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从雨夜的青石巷口疾速推进，掠过湿滑的石板与斜织的冷雨，聚焦于那道灰影少年左脚踏地的瞬间爆发——长剑嗡鸣出鞘，剑锋撕裂雨幕直刺前方黑衣少年咽喉，布袍下摆随冲势猎猎翻卷，剑尖破空带起一串水珠飞溅；急速跟拍这一击，最终凝在剑锋距黑衣少年喉前三寸的刹那，雨丝在刃口边缘劈开两道细痕。远处雷声闷响，雨滴敲打屋檐声急促。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 12.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"steps\": 8, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 12, \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"steps\": 8}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164834_5edbf3cd02efd5ae.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-28T08:33:36.329005+00:00','2026-08-28T08:38:14.628324+00:00','2026-08-28T08:38:14.627805+00:00',274139),('831977c3-2b8c-43ab-bc75-7d861b6b6fe0','LCiavhhSUFkM',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE master reference image for this scene.\n\nSCENE NAME: 山洞\nSCENE TYPE: interior\nSCENE DESCRIPTION (environment notes only; ignore people and story action):\n天然山洞，内部干燥，角落堆放大量物资，如矿泉水、罐头等，洞内有简易躺椅，光线由露营灯提供，环境相对安全。\n\nPROJECT STYLE PRESET:\n- Apply only materials, palette, linework and lighting from: warm 3D character animation, friendly proportions, soft lighting, colorful world, expressive emotions\n- This is an EMPTY LOCATION plate, not a fashion editorial, character poster, or magazine cover.\n- Ignore posing, models, portraits, and any people implied by the style preset.\n\nPURPOSE:\n- This image is the primary visual master for storyboard, render, and first-frame production.\n- Spatial coverage: the front-facing 180-degree half of the scene (front center plus roughly half of the left side and half of the right side).\n- Keep a clean canonical front-facing wide scene reference.\n\nANCHOR THE FRONT WALL FROM THE TEXT:\n- Read SCENE DESCRIPTION for 正面 / front side / 主面 / 主入口 / 正前方.\n- Whatever the text describes as the FRONT (正面) is the wall the camera looks at.\n- If the text says \"正面是 X\", X is the main feature across the back of the frame.\n- Do NOT swap front and back. Labels 背面 / 后面 are BEHIND the camera and must not appear.\n- Labels 左侧 / 右侧 are side zones visible as partial left/right coverage.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n- Canonical FRONT-FACING establishing angle. Eye-level horizon.\n- No back view, no rear angle, no aerial, no fisheye, no VR, no 360 panorama.\n- Wide establishing framing with about 160-180 degrees of horizontal coverage.\n\nEMPTY LOCATION CONTRACT:\n- Output an unoccupied set, as if photographed before actors arrive.\n- SCENE DESCRIPTION may mention character names or story action (跪、站、坐、咳血、议论). Those are NOTES, not subjects.\n- Do NOT draw any person, face, body, silhouette, crowd, corpse, ghost, or character occupying the space.\n- Keep only architecture and fixed dressings that remain after people leave (walls, floor, ceiling, bed, window, furniture, lamps).\n- Do not turn the frame into a story beat, portrait, or fashion shot.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- No people, no characters, no temporary story props.\n- Preserve only fixed environment objects: walls, floor, ceiling, doors, windows,\n  counters, tables, seats, shelves, lamps, appliances, architectural trim, exterior fixtures.\n- No readable text, labels, UI, watermarks, collage, floorplan, or diagrams.\n- FRONT-FACING HALF ONLY.\n- Output one finished scene reference image only.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-08T02:07:21.300060+00:00','2026-09-08T02:08:14.429294+00:00','2026-09-08T02:08:14.425190+00:00',NULL),('83233e55-d870-48b7-9d02-6f69f461df1d','GFblEQFQe8ag',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> is the character same young Chinese male cultivator, deep teal rain cloak with fixed left-shoulder tear, dark narrow-sleeved robe, bronze medicine case on left waist, rain-wet hair shown in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 2> is the character same young Chinese female sword cultivator, pale gray-green rain-soaked fitted outfit, low ponytail, white bandage on right wrist, narrow sword on back shown in <Picture 3>.\n<Subject 3> is the character same tall slim man in a black conical hat and wet black cloak, pale lower face only, engraved silver ring on left hand shown in <Picture 4>.\n<Subject 4> is the scene abandoned rain-soaked herb garden overgrown with vines, half-buried stone stele with a fresh cinnabar handprint at front center, cracked low wall behind it, dark cave entrance at back right, fixed muddy puddles and broken herb racks, stylized Chinese fantasy animation shown in <Picture 5>.\n<Subject 5> is the prop palm-sized aged bronze medicine case with verdigris edges, rounded rectangular lid, thin amber light from its seam, tied at the hero\'s left waist by a dark cord; keep the same object throughout shown in <Picture 6>.\n<Subject 6> is the prop small pale green jade token with one diagonal crack, rain-wet surface, intermittent faint warm amber glow from the crack, no lettering; same crack and scale throughout shown in <Picture 7>.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video uses <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, <Subject 3>, <Subject 4>, <Subject 5>, <Subject 6> as its referenced visible elements and the supplied keyframes while playing the described actions, camera moves, and diegetic sound.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, subjects, and lighting remain the starting state of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 6> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a medium shot at eye-level frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: 承接叶清璃剑尖所指的右侧藤蔓小径。. Start state: begin on the vine path indicated by Ye Qingli\'s sword tip. Ye walks at screen right front and Lu follows at screen left rear; preserve their positions, wet clothing, jade in Lu\'s right hand, and bronze case at his left waist. One visible change: they push through vines into the abandoned herb garden. A distant lightning flash briefly silhouettes the black-hatted steward far behind them, without bringing him closer. End state: their boots reach mud; a fresh cinnabar-red reflection of the half-buried stone stele appears in a puddle. End this clip on: 泥水倒映半埋石碑的朱砂红；执事仍只在远处轮廓中。. The camera follows with a tracking shot with small amplitude at slow speed. The shot begins from <Picture 1>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nvines scraping, thunder\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n低频箫与极轻鼓点；前两场被雨声覆盖，石门合上后只留一条低音持续。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\1_shot-wuling-03_end.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\2_c2PpC02pMX9S.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\3_CMEZSiqc4V1n.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\4_dJ5dsnWjjbjZ.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\5_4in6zSfWKj.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\6_6bVCWTsxou5.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\GFblEQFQe8ag\\\\7_BaqnUdMhtfzV.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-03T04:15:31.344503+00:00','2026-09-03T05:01:45.496803+00:00','2026-09-03T05:01:49.074826+00:00',2766995),('83345828-28b8-4659-986f-d0911fed7b46','80A1ykaI8k3V',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate a 3-PANEL product reference sheet for a story prop.\n\nLAYOUT (1x3, 16:9 overall):\n- Three equal unlabeled panels arranged left to right\n- Left panel: front view\n- Middle panel: side profile\n- Right panel: back view\n- Do not draw panel titles, angle labels, captions, numbers, arrows, or divider text\n\nINPUT IMAGE:\n- REFERENCE 1 = the FRONT hero master of this same prop.\n- Keep identical silhouette, materials, wear, palette and construction.\n- Do NOT copy REFERENCE 1 as a single frontal photo; expand it into the 1x3 three-panel sheet.\n\nSTYLE SOURCE:\n- Visual style comes ENTIRELY from REFERENCE 1. Match art style, materials, palette and lighting.\n\nPROP NAME: 旧短刀\nPROP TYPE: weapon\nOWNER / WIELDER: 陈平安\nPROP DESCRIPTION:\n身挂旧短刀，小巧锋利，刀身锈迹斑斑，材质铁制。\n\nFRONT VIEW: Straight-on frontal view of the prop, showing its face/main side\nSIDE PROFILE: 90-degree side view showing the prop\'s profile and thickness\nBACK VIEW: Straight-on rear view of the same prop, showing rear-side details, straps, seams, closures, ports, or worn backside surfaces\n\nPRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY STYLE:\n- Clean white or light gray seamless background\n- Soft studio lighting, no harsh shadows\n- Object centered, filling approximately 70% of each panel\n- High detail rendering of materials, textures, and surface finishes\n- Professional product shot quality\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- NO people, hands, fingers, or living creatures\n- Object only, isolated on clean background\n- Each panel must be distinguishable by object angle only, never by written labels\n- Consistent lighting, scale, silhouette, and material identity across all three panels\n- Show fine details: gems, stitching, weathering, non-text surface marks, etc.\n- No readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary for the prop design, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n\nMUST AVOID:\n- Do NOT add text, labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, signatures, readable letters, Chinese characters, or English words\n- Do NOT include any people, hands, or body parts\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\80A1ykaI8k3V\\\\1_8KnTE6435WBV.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-07T02:36:32.420007+00:00','2026-09-07T02:38:48.711661+00:00','2026-09-07T02:38:48.709486+00:00',NULL),('834f6c5a-81ad-4a89-a2f2-a1cd39ff44b7','iq3RCAAzOyHc',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Character identity reference sheet. Neutral studio setup.\nPLAIN SOLID WHITE or LIGHT GRAY background ONLY — no environment, no scenery, no props. premium VFX realism, photoreal 3D rendering, cinematic lighting, detailed textures, high-end visual effects\n\nUsi