t 1> in a city CBD building complex. At 00:00.000, <Subject 1> stands with a tablet, looking tired. At 00:00.500, <Subject 1> taps the app on the tablet. At 00:01.500, a drone rises from a warehouse in the background. At 00:02.500, <Subject 1> places an insulated box on the drone. At 00:02.500, <Subject 1> says: <d>今天又是满箱好评，希望这次别出岔子。</d> The camera then pushes in slowly with small amplitude, ending the clip at 00:05.000.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nUrban background sounds, including light app click sounds and occasional city ambience.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nSynthwave with strings and percussion, tempo 120 BPM, dynamic shifts from soft intro to intense crescendo for suspense.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\7YeQLgx1viHB\\\\1_i8U5w2e7wi8.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-01T17:41:28.177227+00:00','2026-09-01T17:50:00.194500+00:00','2026-09-01T17:50:00.194005+00:00',503639),('8bc35d8a-156f-4f5a-9bbf-63c2947f48f3','TJwxmWmWW85Z',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE master reference image for this scene.\n\nSCENE NAME: 泥瓶巷\nSCENE TYPE: exterior\nSCENE DESCRIPTION (environment notes only; ignore people and story action):\n狭窄石板路，两旁矮屋，灯笼稀疏，潮湿气味，雨水顺着屋檐滴落，形成水洼。\n\nPROJECT STYLE PRESET:\n- Apply only materials, palette, linework and lighting from: expressive adventure CG, bold character design, vibrant colors, dynamic camera angle, animated storytelling\n- This is an EMPTY LOCATION plate, not a fashion editorial, character poster, or magazine cover.\n-