LL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-07T06:59:50.137935+00:00','2026-09-07T07:03:02.788526+00:00','2026-09-07T07:03:01.915478+00:00',NULL),('8c1cb2e4-c50e-45bc-a13e-49327a06bb53','eJIkqElZUugA',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从低角度跟随一只毛茸茸的棕色兔子在阳光斑驳的森林赛道上疾驰，它后腿蹬地跃过一片浅土，前爪轻盈点地继续加速，身后扬起细碎尘土；摄像机向右横移跟拍，逐渐拉近至兔子摆动的耳朵和快速起伏的背部，结束在一个紧凑的侧跟镜头。远处，一只背甲深绿的乌龟正缓慢爬行于泥道边缘。林间微风轻拂树叶沙沙作响。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"steps\": 4, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 5, \"megapixels\": 0.2}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164916_4408f871b8b95496.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-28T02:34:49.590917+00:00','2026-08-28T02:37:33.235846+00:00','2026-08-28T02:37:33.234847+00:00',161287),('8c5125e3-6752-4a5d-8027-8b9132db597c','tFXIkQ3BZDKC',1,'minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从低角度缓缓上摇，掠过草地纹理，聚焦到一只乌龟平静抬起的头，它的嘴部微张合动，缓慢而清晰地吐出话语，前爪轻轻向前一伸做出邀请手势，镜头继续平滑前推，最终定格在它坚定凝视的双眼特写，森林的光影在它身后柔化成一片斑驳光晕，远处传来树叶沙沙的轻响。 Says: 跑得快不代表一定能到终点。我们比一场吧。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"steps\": 4, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 5, \"megapixels\": 0.2}