d environment objects: walls, floor, ceiling, doors, windows,\n  counters, tables, seats, shelves, lamps, appliances, architectural trim, exterior fixtures.\n- No readable text, labels, UI, watermarks, collage, floorplan, or diagrams.\n- FRONT-FACING HALF ONLY.\n- Output one finished scene reference image only.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-08T02:05:23.046811+00:00','2026-09-08T02:06:11.952805+00:00','2026-09-08T02:06:11.949782+00:00',NULL),('9888f0c8-6706-4a70-b60d-8787b70906b5','ddA4JVzlP7d',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Render this sketch into a high-quality colored production still. Image 1 / SKETCH IS the base drawing — preserve ALL composition, crop, poses, and camera angles exactly. Other reference images lock identity only and must not change the sketch layout. CRITICAL: Keep exact composition from sketch. Only add color, texture, and lighting. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k. CHARACTERS (match face references): 齐静春 (sketch marker AMBER #D97706) 男性，中年，黑色短发，深邃丹凤眼，小麦肤色，方正脸型 为保护百姓而牺牲的武者，心怀正义，武力高强。 为保护百姓而牺牲的武者，心怀正义，武力高强。; 陈平安 (sketch marker PINK #DB2777) 男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，明亮有神的眼睛，小麦肤色，棱角分明的脸型 从废人境起步，通过不懈努力突破至武夫境界，性格坚韧不拔。 从废人境起步，通过不懈努力突破至武夫境界，性格坚韧不拔。. SCENE: 骊珠洞天. 古老的洞天福地，灵气充沛，洞内有古老的阵法和建筑，即将崩塌。. 【外】骊珠洞天 日 骊珠洞天天空出现裂缝，地面震动，裂缝蔓延。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\ddA4JVzlP7d\\\\1_FZoyDSysjCgS.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uplo