t video uses a hyperreal manga fusion style with realistic world elements and stylized anime energy, including expressive faces and clean dramatic lighting. [Shot 1] A medium shot focuses on <Subject 1>, the tired 28-year-old male programmer with glasses, as he rubs his eyes and continues typing on a keyboard. The computer screen reflects code, and in the foreground is an empty coffee cup. Environment: <Subject 2> is depicted with dim lighting, empty coffee cups, and programming books on the desk, while <Subject 3> establishes the setting with an empty company meeting room in the background, enhancing the cinematic atmosphere. Action: He types slowly, showing signs of fatigue. Camera: Static shot at eye level with slight dramatic lighting to emphasize exhaustion; the camera pushes in subtly at a slow speed to build tension. Dialogue: None. No cuts or additional shots.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nThe ambience includes the sound of keyboard typing and computer fan noise in a quiet, late-night office setting.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n电子氛围','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"steps\": 4, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"fast\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164818_7cf6b0426a34deb2.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164838_8af65a4414ea6b7f.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164841_470c274e084eb34c.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-28T09:52:42.098609+00:00','2026-08-28T10:28:10.211111+00:00','2026-08-28T10:28:10.210111+00:00',372156),('9d964ef8-15f1-4149-8603-22d561718d7d','O