s TRANSITION: Add a gentle push-in shot from medium to close-up on the bowl, camera rising slightly, highlighting the approaching figure and the tap action; micro-acting: Gu Can\'s eyes slightly lift with a hint of gratitude; cloth dynamics: no change; environment reaction: dust settling, light softening; intensifies the same beat by focusing on the bowl\'s movement.\nCUT 2 from 4.5 seconds: Switch to close-up on the bowl, overhead low-angle shot, slight pan movement, emphasizing the rim tapping detail; Gu Can\'s head slightly raises, expression transitioning from despair to mild hope; cloth dynamics: attire remains static; environment reaction: light diffuses evenly, dust minimal; focus remains on the bowl\'s crisp animation.\nFrom 6.5 seconds HOLD: Maintain medium shot composition, camera stable, Gu Can\'s body trembling slightly, the figure steps back, bowl held steady; micro-acting: slight eye movement showing awareness; cloth dynamics: clothes undisturbed; environment reaction: indoor silence, light uniform; extends the beat with sustained observation.\nFrom 8.5 seconds TRANSITION: Camera slowly pulls out from close-up to wide-angle view of the alley, bowl vanishes, focus reverts to Gu Can\'s collapsed position; micro-acting: no emotional change; cloth dynamics: clothes settle; environment reaction: lingering dust, light fading subtly; concludes on a clear frame at 10 seconds, ensuring continuity with the beat.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.2\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 10.0, \"speed\": \"balanced\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"steps\": 8, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_ref2v_turbo_4step_v0.1_comfyui_bf16.safetensors\", \"lora_strength\": 0.75, \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"sampler_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"duration\": 10.0, \"quality\": \"0.2\", \"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"speed\": \"balanced\"}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\