ed','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE isolated FRONT product photograph of this story prop.\n\nPROP NAME: 陶罐\nPROP TYPE: artifact\nOWNER / WIELDER: 陈平安\nPROP DESCRIPTION:\n一个破损的陶罐，内装碎瓷片，表面有裂纹，颜色暗淡，大小适中，材质粗糙，象征着破碎的过往和希望。\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\ncyber editorial, futuristic fashion, neon accents, magazine composition, high contrast tech aesthetic\n\nPURPOSE:\n- This is the primary visual master (主视图): the FRONT / most characteristic face of the prop.\n- Straight-on frontal view of a SINGLE object, showing its face/main side.\n- Not a 3-PANEL sheet, not a collage, not a 4-panel grid, not a macro crop of one fragment.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n- 16:9 overall. Object centered, filling approximately 70% of the frame.\n- One finished product shot only.\n\nPRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY STYLE:\n- Clean white or light gray seamless background\n- Soft studio lighting, no harsh shadows\n- Object centered, filling approximately 70% of the frame\n- High detail rendering of materials, textures, and surface finishes\n- Professional product shot quality\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- NO people, hands, fingers, or living creatures\n- Object only, isolated on clean background\n- Show fine details: gems, stitching, weathering, non-text surface marks, etc.\n- No readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary for the prop design, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n\nMUST AVOID:\n- Do NOT add text, labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, signatures, readable letters, Chinese characters, or English words\n- Do NOT include any people, hands, or body parts\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-07T03:01:42.663169+00:00','2026-09-07T03:02:42.775976+00:00','2026-09-07T03:02:42.773213+00:00',NULL),('e7828fd1-8b10-445e-999d-f4f308178a86','v7GmgPYJGt',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate a 3-PANEL product reference sheet for a story prop.\n\nLAYOUT (1x3, 16:9 overall):\n- Three equal unlabeled panels arranged left to right\n- Left panel: front view\n- Middle panel: side profile\n- Right panel: back view\n- Do not draw panel titles, angle labels, captions, numbers, arrows, or divider text\n\nINPUT IMAGE:\n- REFERENCE 1 = the FRONT hero master of this same prop.\n- Keep identical silhouette, materials, wear, palette and construction.\n- Do NOT copy REFERENCE 1 as a single frontal photo; expand it into the 1x3 three-panel sheet.\n\nSTYLE SOURCE:\n- Visual style comes ENTIRELY from REFERENCE 1. Match art style, materials, palette and lighting.\n\nPROP NAME: 购车合同\nPROP TYPE: document\nOWNER / WIELDER: 兔女士\nPROP DESCRIPTION:\n一张纸质文件，包含条款和签名区域，设计简洁，尺寸标准。\n\nFRONT VIEW: Straight-on frontal view of the prop, showing its face/main side\nSIDE PROFILE: 90-degree side view showing the prop\'s profile and thickness\nBACK VIEW: Straight-on rear view of the same prop, showing rear-side details, straps, seams, closures, ports, or worn backside surfaces\n\nPRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY STYLE:\n- Clean white or light gray seamless background\n- Soft studio lighting, no harsh shadows\n- Object centered, filling approximately 70% of each panel\n- High detail rendering of materials, textures, and surface finishes\n- Professional product shot quality\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- NO people, hands, fingers, or living creatures\n- Object only, isolated on clean background\n- Each panel must be distinguishable by object angle only, never by written labels\n- Consistent lighting, scale, silhouette, and material identity across all three panels\n- Show fine details: gems, stitching, weathering, non-text surface marks, etc.\n- No readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary for the prop design, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n\nMUST AVOID:\n- Do NOT add text, labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, signatures, readable letters, Chinese characters, or English words\n- Do NOT include any people, hands, or body parts\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\v7GmgPYJGt\\\\1_usBxumcL8dx.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-04T01:47:01.437625+00:00','2026-09-04T01:48:00.326236+00:00','2026-09-04T01:48:00.323750+00:00',NULL),('e85c1246-6b7e-4fa3-91ff-5483022ba4f8','lZmIxlZ1fjT',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','failed','图片生成失败',90,'Render this sketch into a high-quality colored production still. Image 1 / SKETCH IS the base drawing — preserve ALL composition, crop, poses, and camera angles exactly. Other reference images lock identity only and must not change the sketch layout. After the sketch, character attachments are FACE then COSTUME for each named character in order. FACE locks identity; COSTUME locks clothing. Do not treat a costume sheet as the face. CRITICAL: Keep exact composition from sketch. Only add color, texture, and lighting. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k. CHARACTERS (match face references): 陈平安 (sketch marker AMBER #D97706) 男性，youth，黑色短发，蓝色眼睛，普通肤色，圆脸. SCENE: 骊珠洞天. 一个即将崩塌的神秘洞天，周围是小镇和百姓，环境险峻，危机四伏。. 陈平安在落魄山遇到崔诚，被拳击打中，浑身是伤。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\lZmIxlZ1fjT\\\\1_jHF4NdJa5Q.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\lZmIxlZ1fjT\\\\2_9H40jH5d0bXB.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\lZmIxlZ1fjT\\\\3_M4Uqfc8pxydz.png\"]','内容未通过审核（可能含真人等受限内容）：We are so sorry, but the prompt may violate our content policies. If you think we got it wrong, please retry or edit your prompt.','2026-09-04T08:02:01.421749+00:00','2026-09-04T08:07:46.254329+00:00','2026-09-04T08:07:46.251879+00:00',NULL),('ea74c448-639f-4169-af0c-35d1e39fce19','arp3ItifOFj',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate a 360-degree equirectangular panorama image in exact 2:1 aspect ratio for scene `落魄山`.\n\nINPUT IMAGE ROLES:\n- Reference image 1 (master.png) = PRIMARY VISUAL BIBLE.\n- It locks the scene identity, art style, materials, palette, lighting and front-half fixtures.\n- It shows the FRONT-FACING HEMISPHERE: front center plus visible left and right halves.\n- It does NOT show the back hemisphere behind the camera.\n- Preserve the visual DNA of master.png. Expand the same location into 360 degrees.\n- Reference image 2 (reverse_master.png) = BACK-HALF VISUAL BIBLE.\n- It locks the BACK-FACING HEMISPHERE of the same scene.\n- Stitch with master.png: reverse left edge connects to master right edge,\n  reverse right edge connects to master left edge.\n- It is the exact yaw-180 opposite of master, not another forward view.\n- Do NOT invent a different back side when reverse_master.png is attached.\n\nSCENE NAME: 落魄山\nSCENE TYPE: exterior\nSCENE DESCRIPTION:\n隐于市的山林，止境武夫所在，环境幽静，武道气息浓厚。\n\nLAYER MODE: FULL ENVIRONMENT\n- Complete environment and fixed fixtures only. No people, no story action, no temporary props.\n\nPROJECTION REQUIREMENTS:\n- Correct equirectangular spherical panorama, one continuous 2:1 image for a VR/360 viewer.\n- Camera fixed at scene center at human eye height. Full 360-degree environment.\n- Left and right edges must connect with no visible seam. Horizon level and centered.\n- No single flat wide shot, no cubemap atlas, no borders, no multi-panel sheet.\n\nNEGATIVE REQUIREMENTS:\n- Not a normal wide-angle illustration. Not fisheye. Not cubemap faces.\n- No labels, UI, watermark, broken seam, duplicated doorway at seam, or mirrored halves.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:1\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:1\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\arp3ItifOFj\\\\1_wBCtELfWur6p.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\arp3ItifOFj\\\\2_6s94KoINgri1.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-04T02:46:14.148261+00:00','2026-09-04T02:47:18.213510+00:00','2026-09-04T02:47:18.210974+00:00',NULL),('eb639ee8-038b-4bda-800f-a3cb399ef3f7','7KwKDbftLuy',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> is the character same young Chinese male cultivator, deep teal rain cloak with fixed left-shoulder tear, dark narrow-sleeved robe, bronze medicine case on left waist, rain-wet hair shown in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 2> is the scene night rain on a narrow cliffside wooden boardwalk, wet black rock wall on the left, mist-filled abyss on the right, distant mountain gate swallowed by fog ahead, puddles between planks reflecting faint amber talisman light, stylized Chinese fantasy animation shown in <Picture 3>.\n<Subject 3> is the prop palm-sized aged bronze medicine case with verdigris edges, rounded rectangular lid, thin amber light from its seam, tied at the hero\'s left waist by a dark cord; keep the same object throughout shown in <Picture 4>.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video uses <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, <Subject 3> as its referenced visible elements and the supplied keyframes while playing the described actions, camera moves, and diegetic sound.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, subjects, and lighting remain the starting state of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a medium shot at eye-level frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: 药匣倒影仍在水洼中. 承接上一镜水洼里的琥珀倒影，镜头沿陆沉舟右手移到他回头的视线，再落到身后逐渐被雨水冲淡的陌生脚印；只保留雨声、远雷和衣料摩擦，不出现旁白。. End this clip on: 陆沉舟的视线锁定最后一个脚印. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. The shot begins from <Picture 1>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n雨声持续、远雷、湿衣摩擦\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n低频箫与极轻鼓点；前两场被雨声覆盖，石门合上后只留一条低音持续。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\7KwKDbftLuy\\\\1_shot-wuling-narration-01_end.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\7KwKDbftLuy\\\\2_c2PpC02pMX9S.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\7KwKDbftLuy\\\\3_MAbBqGS0iBdo.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\7KwKDbftLuy\\\\4_6bVCWTsxou5.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-03T07:23:27.017176+00:00','2026-09-03T08:32:32.988454+00:00','2026-09-03T08:32:11.924595+00:00',573215),('eb860abe-0747-46bf-88da-dd6281770a0a','r0a5iBOLV7Rj',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE reverse-angle establishing image of the SAME outdoor location.\n\nStand where the front master camera stood, then yaw-rotate 180 degrees to face the back side / opposite side of the location.\nThe two views are the SAME location at the SAME moment.\n\nINPUT IMAGE:\n- REFERENCE 1 = the FRONT-FACING master of this location.\n- It covers front center plus roughly half of left and right. It does NOT show the back-facing half.\n- You are showing what is BEHIND REFERENCE 1\'s camera after a 180-degree yaw.\n- Do NOT copy REFERENCE 1\'s front-center composition.\n\nSTYLE SOURCE:\n- Visual style comes ENTIRELY from REFERENCE 1 (the front master). Match its art style, materials, palette, lighting and exposure. Do not re-derive style from text.\n\nSCENE NAME: 小镇石桥河畔\nSCENE TYPE: exterior\nSCENE DESCRIPTION:\n晨雾缭绕的石桥河畔，青石板路，陈平安牵着老犬走过。\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n- Eye-level horizon, wide ~160-180° coverage: back center plus half of left and right.\n- Camera faces the back side / opposite side of the location (SCENE DESCRIPTION 背面 / back / 后).\n- If the text says \"背面是 X\", X is the focal content of this image.\n- The front-facing subject of the master is now behind the camera and should not dominate this frame.\n\nREQUIRED EDGE OVERLAP:\n- Reverse LEFT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s RIGHT edge.\n- Reverse RIGHT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s LEFT edge.\n\nCENTER REGION:\n- Show what is behind the master\'s camera. Fill from 背面 notes. Do not invent objects absent from text and master.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- Eye-level wide rectilinear perspective. NO fisheye, NO equirectangular panorama, NO 360 unwrap, NO floorplan, NO collage.\n- 16:9 aspect ratio. One finished establishing image.\n- No people, no readable text, labels, or watermarks.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\r0a5iBOLV7Rj\\\\1_OKJK4EUOwwbA.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-07T02:36:48.752038+00:00','2026-09-07T02:41:18.513433+00:00','2026-09-07T02:41:18.511404+00:00',NULL),('ec33970b-5822-457d-a2eb-fd20d7dca2e5','1YDENE3NArEI',1,'minimax-h3-t2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium shot at eye-level frames the scene with epic cinematic style, dramatic lighting, and rich atmosphere, emphasizing emotional visual storytelling. A young cultivator, Li Yuanying, stands before an ancient library holding a glowing stone aloft. At 00:00.000, he beams with joy. The cultivator (Li Yuanying) says: <d>[Chinese] 这灵石品质极高，不知能炼制多少法宝。</d> At 00:04.000, the camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed as he continues to admire the stone. The scene holds for the remainder of the shot until 00:06.000.\n\noverall_soundscape: Gentle wind blowing through ancient stone walls, accompanied by faint rustling from books in the library and distant, ethereal whispers.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: An orchestral score with strings and brass, featuring a moderate tempo that gradually shifts to fast with dynamic swells and crescendos, evoking a sense of wonder and power.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 1.0, \"duration\": 4.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 4}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-01T10:01:11.304951+00:00','2026-09-01T10:13:54.386646+00:00','2026-09-01T10:13:54.385646+00:00',761902),('ec46d745-b40f-4dd4-bbd7-2eed74560a70','bU5Iro07qT1v',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Render this sketch into a high-quality colored production still. Image 1 / SKETCH IS the base drawing — preserve ALL composition, crop, poses, and camera angles exactly. Other reference images lock identity only and must not change the sketch layout. CRITICAL: Keep exact composition from sketch. Only add color, texture, and lighting. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k. CHARACTERS (match face references): 齐静春 (sketch marker AMBER #D97706) 男性，中年，黑色短发，深邃丹凤眼，小麦肤色，方正脸型 为保护百姓而牺牲的武者，心怀正义，武力高强。 为保护百姓而牺牲的武者，心怀正义，武力高强。; 陈平安 (sketch marker PINK #DB2777) 男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，明亮有神的眼睛，小麦肤色，棱角分明的脸型 从废人境起步，通过不懈努力突破至武夫境界，性格坚韧不拔。 从废人境起步，通过不懈努力突破至武夫境界，性格坚韧不拔。. SCENE: 骊珠洞天. 古老的洞天福地，灵气充沛，洞内有古老的阵法和建筑，即将崩塌。. 【外】骊珠洞天 日 骊珠洞天天空出现裂缝，地面震动，裂缝蔓延。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\bU5Iro07qT1v\\\\1_FZoyDSysjCgS.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\bU5Iro07qT1v\\\\2_5bvyZRsVhTM2.png\", \"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\bU5Iro07q