r_name\": \"euler\", \"shift_video\": 12.0, \"shift_audio\": 3.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"9:16\", \"duration\": 5, \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"steps\": 8}',1,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164921_d71dcc7883620481.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-28T03:00:19.793102+00:00','2026-08-28T03:03:30.691117+00:00','2026-08-28T03:03:30.691117+00:00',188452),('ecc43776-30ef-4af6-bbe1-8e863f28da9d','ZweSoNEbtBOy',1,'minimax-h3-t2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Enchanted fantasy 3D render, cinematic style, a medium shot at eye-level frames the scene with magical atmosphere, glowing details, rich textures, and whimsical lighting. A lone figure of Han Ling stands on a mountain peak, the残破玉简 glowing faintly in his hand. He looks up at the sky with a thoughtful expression on his face. As he casts《敛天术》，a flash of memory shows Han Yuping\'s smiling face. The camera starts static, then slowly rotates with small amplitude at slow speed to emphasize the glow. Han Ling speaks with a calm, measured voice (S1): <d>[Chinese] 雨萍师姐...您当年用生命护我，如今...学生必不会辱没此等恩情...</d>. The camera then pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed.\n\noverall_soundscape: Whispering wind, faint humming from the玉简, and nostalgic ambient sounds create a serene yet reflective atmosphere.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"fast\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 4, \"lora_strength\": 1.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"fast\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-01T03:46:52.090154+00:00','2026-09-01T03:51:15.269906+00:00','2026-09-01T03:51:15.268905+00:00',246461),('ed5639b7-a069-4911-994a-127080832134','LZlyUo7iHHKZ',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','failed','图片生成失败',38,'ROLE: You are a MASTER FILM DIRECTOR and storyboard artist. TASK: Draw ONE panel as a rushed film director storyboard scribble on cheap white paper. This is a blocking thumbnail, not a finished illustration. STYLE: loose pencil/marker doodle, imperfect strokes, deliberately unpolished, raw thumbnail-grade draft. Completely uninterested in artistic finish. WHITE PAPER BACKGROUND ONLY. No photographic production still, no cinematic lighting, no grayscale rendering, no gradients, no shadows, no material shading, no texture, no digital art, no vector clean-up. SYMBOLIC STORYBOARD PEOPLE ONLY: oval head, one spine line, single-stroke arms/legs, tiny facing ticks. NO clothing, no hair, no facial features, no skin, no realistic anatomy. SINGLE-MOMENT RULE: exactly one camera setup and one frozen story moment. No collage, split-screen, subtitles, watermark, or readable text. If a scene reference is attached, redraw it as sparse black/gray line art only. Do NOT copy realistic lighting, colors, texture, or rendered detail. World/setting cue only (do not render as a finished still). Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. CHARACTER COLOR MARKERS: 刺客 = solid INDIGO fill #4F46E5 featureless mannequin. named prop 暗器链子: simple silhouette / marker shape, no material finish. named prop 刀: simple silhouette / marker shape, no material finish. ACTION (source of truth): 刺客呼吸平稳，气息内敛。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"2:3\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]','内容未通过审核（可能含真人等受限内容）：抱歉，我需要先说明：你提供的是生成提示词，但当前对话里没有可用于参考或编辑的原始图片目标。如果你希望基于某张场景图/人物图进行重绘，请先上传对应图片，我再根据你的提示词生成 2:3 比例的分镜草图。','2026-09-02T09:21:24.036156+00:00','2026-09-02T09:23:15.056515+00:00','2026-09-02T09:23:15.053945+00:00',NULL),('edc8b214-241b-4201-80d7-5c770470b765','U28XdiBQk9C',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE isolated FRONT product photograph of this story prop.\n\nPROP NAME: 草鞋与半本书\nPROP TYPE: accessory\nOWNER / WIELDER: 陈十一\nPROP DESCRIPTION:\n粗麻草鞋，鞋底磨损，书页泛黄，边角卷曲，似道家典籍，材质为普通纸张，书页间夹着干枯花瓣。\n\nVISUAL STYLE:\nexpressive adventure CG, bold character design, vibrant colors, dynamic camera angle, animated storytelling\n\nPURPOSE:\n- This is the primary visual master (主视图): the FRONT / most characteristic face of the prop.\n- Straight-on frontal view of a SINGLE object, showing its face/main side.\n- Not a 3-PANEL sheet, not a collage, not a 4-panel grid, not a macro crop of one fragment.\n\nCOMPOSITION:\n- 16:9 overall. Object centered, filling approximately 70% of the frame.\n- One finished product shot only.\n\nPRODUCT PHOTOGRAPHY STYLE:\n- Clean white or light gray seamless background\n- Soft studio lighting, no harsh shadows\n- Object centered, filling approximately 70% of the frame\n- High detail rendering of materials, textures, and surface finishes\n- Professional product shot quality\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- NO people, hands, fingers, or living creatures\n- Object only, isolated on clean background\n- Show fine details: gems, stitching, weathering, non-text surface marks, etc.\n- No readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary for the prop design, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n\nMUST AVOID:\n- Do NOT add text, labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, signatures, readable letters, Chinese characters, or English words\n- Do NOT include any people, hands, or body parts\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[]',NULL,'2026-09-07T06:59:58.928100+00:00','2026-09-07T07:03:43.963468+00:00','2026-09-07T07:03:42.701763+00:00',NULL);
INSERT INTO `job_rounds` VALUES ('edf0c4ee-546b-4a06-a463-6381f1964dd3','rVgTKEyFdYfn',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','failed','生成失败',0,'subject_definitions:\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> is the character same young Chinese male cultivator, deep teal rain cloak with fixed left-shoulder tear, dark narrow-sleeved robe, bronze medicine case on left waist, rain-wet hair shown in <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 2> is the character same young Chinese female sword cultivator, pale gray-green rain-soaked fitted outfit, low ponytail, white bandage on right wrist, narrow sword on back shown in <Picture 3>.\n<Subject 3> is the character same tall slim man in a black conical hat and wet black cloak, pale lower face only, engraved silver ring on left hand shown in <Picture 4>.\n<Subject 4> is the scene wet narrow stone cave, half-closing stone gate with concentric ritual patterns ahead, recessed ritual socket on the left wall, deeper dark stone passage on the right, shallow water reflecting figures, faint jade and amber talisman light as main illumination, stylized Chinese fantasy animation shown in <Picture 5>.\n<Subject 5> is the prop palm-sized aged bronze medicine case with verdigris edges, rounded rectangular lid, thin amber light from its seam, tied at the hero\'s left waist by a dark cord; keep the same object throughout shown in <Picture 6>.\n<Subject 6> is the prop small pale green jade token with one diagonal crack, rain-wet surface, intermittent faint warm amber glow from the crack, no lettering; same crack and scale throughout shown in <Picture 7>.\n<Subject 7> is the prop narrow yellow talisman paper with dark cinnabar strokes; continuity state progresses only from dry paper to rain-wet attached paper to center-burning paper to red-edged ash ribbon shown in <Picture 8>.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video uses <Subject 1>, <Subject 2>, <Subject 3>, <Subject 4>, <Subject 5>, <Subject 6>, <Subject 7> as its referenced visible elements and the supplied keyframes while playing the described actions, camera moves, and diegetic sound.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, subjects, and lighting remain the starting state of [Shot 1].\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 6> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 7> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a wide shot at eye-level frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: 承接陆沉舟锁定阵眼的视线与药匣。. Start state: continue from Lu Chenzhou staring at the left-wall ritual socket. He drips one drop of herb liquid from the bronze case into the socket. Ye Qingli remains screen right and presses the jade token\'s crack with her sword tip. The patterned stone gate slowly closes toward center. The steward inserts only his left hand into the narrowing seam, silver ring lit by amber. He says exactly in Chinese: <d>[Chinese] 真正的钥匙不是玉牌，是你。</d> Keep all three characters in the same frame. End state: the seam is one palm wide; Lu holds the red-edged burning talisman in his right hand. End this clip on: 石门仅余一掌宽；陆沉舟右手夹着红边燃符。. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. The shot begins from <Picture 1>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nstone gate grinding, low male voice\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n低频箫与极轻鼓点；前两场被雨声覆盖，石门合上后只留一条低音持续。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,'[\"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\1_c2PpC02pMX9S.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\2_CMEZSiqc4V1n.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\3_dJ5dsnWjjbjZ.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\4_YEvcRvmSWFM.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\5_6bVCWTsxou5.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\6_BaqnUdMhtfzV.png\", \"D:\\\\zlyun\\\\Toonflow\\\\本地视频工作台\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN\\\\rVgTKEyFdYfn\\\\7_74Gg0qoSSzls.png\"]','当前只上传了 7 张参考图，不能引用 <Picture 8>。','2026-09-03T09:46:47.935193+00:00','2026-09-03T10:18:51.932739+00:00','2026-09-03T10:18:51.930570+00:00',NULL),('ee6208f0-a00f-4b69-88c2-4aa7157a7954','VGUsu3xYaubp',1,'grs-gpt-image-2','image','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Generate ONE reverse-angle establishing image of the SAME outdoor location.\n\nStand where the front master camera stood, then yaw-rotate 180 degrees to face the back side / opposite side of the location.