he same physical side as master\'s RIGHT edge.\n- Reverse RIGHT edge must connect to the same physical side as master\'s LEFT edge.\n\nCENTER REGION:\n- Show what is behind the master\'s camera. Fill from 背面 notes. Do not invent objects absent from text and master.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- Eye-level wide rectilinear perspective. NO fisheye, NO equirectangular panorama, NO 360 unwrap, NO floorplan, NO collage.\n- 16:9 aspect ratio. One finished establishing image.\n- No people, no readable text, labels, or watermarks.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\FjWgwk39fxf8\\\\1_xXt0CIKwePd.png\"]',NULL,'2026-09-03T02:21:54.253527+00:00','2026-09-03T02:22:55.820884+00:00','2026-09-03T02:22:55.818651+00:00',NULL),('f143ada6-690a-4f0b-a706-de2f96b0aacd','OwWHjQ8bfkfr',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','failed','生成失败',0,'[Subject definitions]:\n<Subject 1> (@ref1) is the character A tired 28-year-old male programmer with glasses, working late at night in an office shown in <Picture 1> [retention: fully_preserved].\n<Subject 2> (@ref2) is the scene A dimly lit office at night, the only light coming from a computer monitor, empty coffee cups and programming books scattered on the desk. shown in <Picture 2> [retention: fully_preserved].\n\n【中景，平视视平线，镜头定焦静止，平稳电影感，低调戏剧性】 epic cinematic scene, dramatic lighting, rich atmosphere, film-grade composition, emotional visual storytelling. 深夜的办公室里，只有李明的电脑屏幕还亮着，他的眼镜反射着代码的光影。咖啡杯已经空了第三杯。\n[音效: 键盘敲击声]','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"1.0\", \"megapixels\": 1.0, \"duration\": 8.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"balanced\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"steps\": 8, \"lora_strength\": 1.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_r