xture, and not documentary-like.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{}',0,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/165004_ee0c111fa5e2123a.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-05T04:34:34.454060+00:00','2026-08-11T07:24:27.950773+00:00',NULL,NULL),('OoODCKm97ACm:round:1','OoODCKm97ACm',1,'minimax-h3-t2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',0,'Create a 5-second original 2D anime action-parody short, 16:9. In a vast moonlit shrine hall filled with warm orange lanterns, a tall long-haired armored warlord with a crimson battle fan faces a white-haired sorcerer in a black high-collar coat. A raven-cloaked illusionist watches from a balcony, and a young lightning swordsman is only a silhouette in the far background. Establish the absurd crossover standoff with a low-angle wide shot, then push to a charged two-person medium shot. Wind stirs the banners; blue sparks and red ember particles gather but no impact happens yet. Crisp cel shading, controlled line art, cinematic anime compositing, dramatic Japanese-style action sound design, no subtitles, no text, no watermark, no logos.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{}',0,'[]',NULL,'2026-08-06T01:56:19.051829+00:00','2026-08-11T07:24:28.183773+00:00',NULL,NULL),('OScJPJSTkyw3:round:1','OScJPJSTkyw3',1,'minimax-h3-i2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',0,'Continue directly from the supplied first frame. Keep all characters, wardrobe, train carriage, and daylight identical. Over 5 seconds, the train continues smoothly. The woman opens a book and settles into a calm expression; behind her, mother and child sit quietly. Slowly pull back to a peaceful wide view of the carriage, leaving a reflective ending. Realistic cinematic social drama, no subtitles, no text, no watermark, no logos, no physical conflict.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"re