ly touching the rim. Lin Chuan and the others stay in the background with low presence and do not steal focus.\r\nAtmosphere: low jazz music, soft rain ambience, and a quiet indoor mood.\r\nOutput requirement: it must clearly look like an animated manhua-style drama, not real people, not realistic skin texture, and not documentary-like.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{}',0,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/165009_7d9566dc93d4604b.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-05T03:42:39.226055+00:00','2026-08-11T07:24:28.009274+00:00',NULL,NULL),('sHEga2239iKO:round:1','sHEga2239iKO',1,'minimax-h3-r2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'The camera slowly pushes in from a dimly lit room corner, gliding over a cluttered desk and stacks of cardboard boxes piled against the wall, finally focusing on a man sitting at the table. He wears a rumpled shirt with a loosened tie, his face buried in his hands. He slowly lifts a clear glass tumbler, his fingertips trembling slightly. A warm, flickering pool of lamplight sways with his breathing, casting deep shadows under his eyes. Through the rain-streaked window, faint city traffic hums in the distance as raindrops begin tapping against the glass, their rhythm gradually intensifying. Moody lighting, shallow depth of field, 35mm film look, atmospheric, high detail.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{}',0,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164834_5edbf3cd02efd5ae.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-06T07:05:11.053401+00:00','2026-08-11T07:24:27.540774+00:00',NULL,NULL),('skufOKCXpXA:round:1','skufOKCXpXA',1,'vace-video','video','failed','生成失败',0,'实拍文艺近景，女生站在驿站门口，纤长指尖轻触透明 AR 眼镜镜框@图1 ，镜片浮动细碎金色诗词光粒，背景虚化青瓦古巷与枝叶，清新治愈质感，画面干净无多余人群，浅景深，焦点落在眼镜。镜头柔和快速向前推进，丝滑柔化快推运镜，镜头穿透一侧的AR眼镜镜片，镜面流淌淡金色粒子特效转场，外部实景缓慢虚化褪去，朦胧水墨光斑过渡画面，轻薄数字光效，随后视线进入眼镜内部幻境空间，白帝城鸟瞰图@图2 ，叠加轻薄鎏金 AR 特效，AR特效缓飘动，镜头慢慢摇起，远景@图3 ，定格。