 short video in Chinese manhua-drama style. It must be non-live-action, non-photorealistic, and clearly animated rather than real people. Use high-quality 2D/2.5D animation aesthetics, clean line art, cel shading, cinematic camera movement, and restrained emotional acting. The setting remains the same neon-lit bar at night, with a quiet, oppressive, and lonely mood. Rain continues outside, and the interior warm light is dim.\r\n\r\nDuration: 5 seconds. Shot design:\r\n0s-1.5s: Start from the reflection inside the drink glass, showing the trembling liquid surface and a blurred reflection of the face to establish inner emotion.\r\n1.5s-3.5s: The camera slowly rises, moving past the rim of the glass to Lin Chuan’s lowered eyes and side profile. He stares at the reflection in the drink with a lonely expression.\r\n3.5s-5s: End on a medium close-up or close-up of Lin Chuan. He raises his eyes slightly, his Adam’s apple moves subtly, and he quietly says: “Because if I don’t drink, I’m unhappy.”\r\n\r\nPerformance focus: Lin Chuan is a young man who feels tired, repressed, and lonely. His performance must be subtle and restrained, not exaggerated. Include only delicate movements such as gentle breathing, a slight lift of the eyelids, and fingers holding the glass.\r\nAtmosphere: light rain tapping the window edge, low and slow jazz in the background, and an overall quiet, oppressive feeling.\r\nOutput requirement: it must clearly look like an animated manhua-style drama, not real people, not realistic skin texture, and not documentary-like.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"megapixels\": 0.2, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\"}','{}',0,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/165017_96af145c5c498acd.png\"]',NULL,'2026-08-05T04:00:42.106414+00:00','2026-08-11T07:24:27.910773+00:00',NULL,NULL),('yctCnVWuuMA:round:1','yctCnVWuuMA',1,'minimax-h3-i2v','video','succeeded','生成完成',100,'镜头从房间角落缓缓推进，掠过昏黄光晕下的斑驳墙壁和凌乱书架，最终聚焦到桌前疲惫的男人。他穿着皱褶的衬衫，领带松垮，双手撑着