ubject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - facial identity, hairstyle, wardrobe, and key visual features are retained.\n<Subject 4> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the environment layout, set dressing, lighting, and atmosphere are retained.\n<Subject 5> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the prop\'s material, form, scale, and key visual features are retained.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] a medium shot at eye-level frames the scene. hyperreal manga fusion, realistic world with stylized anime energy, expressive faces, clean dramatic lighting. Continuity at clip opening: 承接被雷光照亮的朱砂掌印。. Start state: keep the lightning-lit cinnabar handprint in the foreground. Rack focus through the rain to the black-clad steward standing deep at center back, with black conical hat hiding his upper face and engraved silver ring only on his left hand. Lu is screen left and Ye guards screen right. The steward takes only one slow step forward and says exactly in Chinese: <d>[Chinese] 把玉牌交出来，石窟里的东西不该由外门弟子碰。</d> End state: his left silver ring catches a rain highlight while Lu raises the cracked jade token at chest height. End this clip on: 执事左手银戒反光；陆沉舟将玉牌举至胸前。. The camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed. The shot begins from <Picture 1>.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nrain, low male voice\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n低频箫与极轻鼓点；前两场被雨声覆盖，石门合上后只留一条低音持续。','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"megapixels\": 0.4, \"duration\": 5.0, \"reference_image_size\": \"match\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"custom_steps\": 8, \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"use_sage_attention\": true, \"steps\": 20, \"lora_strength\": 0.0, \"lora_name\": \"minimax_h3_turbo_4STEPS_comfyui.safetensors\"}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"quality\": \"0.4\", \"speed\": \"quality\", \"weight_profile\": \"full\", \"duration\": 5}',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"D: