de rectilinear perspective. NO fisheye, NO equirectangular panorama, NO 360 unwrap, NO floorplan, NO collage.\n- 16:9 aspect ratio. One finished establishing image.\n\nEMPTY LOCATION CONTRACT:\n- Output an unoccupied set, as if photographed before actors arrive.\n- SCENE DESCRIPTION may mention character names or story action (跪、站、坐、咳血、议论). Those are NOTES, not subjects.\n- Do NOT draw any person, face, body, silhouette, crowd, corpse, ghost, or character occupying the space.\n- Keep only architecture and fixed dressings that remain after people leave (walls, floor, ceiling, bed, window, furniture, lamps).\n- Do not turn the frame into a story beat, portrait, or fashion shot.\n\nHARD REQUIREMENTS:\n- No people, no characters, no temporary story props.\n- Preserve only fixed environment objects: walls, floor, ceiling, doors, windows,\n  counters, tables, seats, shelves, lamps, appliances, architectural trim, exterior fixtures.\n- No readable text, labels, UI, watermarks, collage, floorplan, or diagrams.','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\lrsvljFiZbeo\\\\1_A0Ucr6FoQRKm.png\"]','[{\"kind\": \"image\", \"path\": \"zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260907/112256_b23b23b41585f6c1.png\", \"label\": \"生成图片\", \"delivery_status\": \"cloud\", \"delivered_at\": null, \"cloud_url\": \"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260907/112256_b23b23b41585f6c1.png\"}]',NULL,'2026-09-07T03:21:35.736701+00:00','2026-09-07T03:23:00.104022+00:00','image','导台2 场景背面 · 破屋内',0,'2c493fdf-79ae-44df-ac1f-7a2824453242',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-07T03:23:00.098501+00:00',NULL),('LsNaF29wTfGU','8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN','grs-gpt-image-2','failed','图片生成失败',12,'futuristic neon noir, glowing city lights, cyber atmosphere, dark ci