ofessional product shot quality\n\nSTRICT REQUIREMENTS:\n- NO people, hands, fingers, or living creatures\n- Object only, isolated on clean background\n- Each panel must be distinguishable by object angle only, never by written labels\n- Consistent lighting, scale, silhouette, and material identity across all three panels\n- Show fine details: gems, stitching, weathering, non-text surface marks, etc.\n- No readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary for the prop design, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n\nMUST AVOID:\n- Do NOT add text, labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, signatures, readable letters, Chinese characters, or English words\n- Do NOT include any people, hands, or body parts\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\pH7sPJYluAkh\\\\1_JUC0NCukJXYU.png\"]','[{\"kind\": \"image\", \"path\": \"zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260907/103731_d13476d4d3fc2694.png\", \"label\": \"生成图片\", \"delivery_status\": \"cloud\", \"delivered_at\": null, \"cloud_url\": \"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260907/103731_d13476d4d3fc2694.png\"}]',NULL,'2026-09-07T02:36:25.493845+00:00','2026-09-07T02:37:39.256629+00:00','image','导台2 道具转面三视图 · 竹笠',0,'2f4605ef-74b2-49a4-801f-7ee395d1c1da',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-07T02:37:39.250670+00:00',NULL),('PKlbIP1UYM','fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm','grs-gpt-image-2','succeeded','生成完成',100,'Animated character turnaround / identity sheet. Neutral presentation setup.\nPLAIN SOLID WHITE or LIGHT GRAY 