o readable writing anywhere, even if the description mentions a cover title, sign, label, document text, engraving, or lettering\n- If text-like markings are necessary for the prop design, render them as abstract unreadable strokes or blank surface texture\n\nMUST AVOID:\n- Do NOT add text, labels, panel titles, captions, numbers, arrows, logos, watermarks, signatures, readable letters, Chinese characters, or English words\n- Do NOT include any people, hands, or body parts\n- Do NOT show the prop being held or worn\n- Do NOT add busy or distracting backgrounds','',NULL,'{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1, \"provider_model\": \"gpt-image-2\", \"poll_interval_seconds\": 5}','{\"aspect_ratio\": \"16:9\", \"resolution\": \"1K\", \"count\": 1}',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"E:\\\\projects\\\\zlyun\\\\zlyflow\\\\data\\\\uploads\\\\fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm\\\\v7GmgPYJGt\\\\1_usBxumcL8dx.png\"]','[{\"kind\": \"image\", \"path\": \"zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260904/094757_3aa99dcaadcb417a.png\", \"label\": \"生成图片\", \"delivery_status\": \"cloud\", \"delivered_at\": null, \"cloud_url\": \"https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260904/094757_3aa99dcaadcb417a.png\"}]',NULL,'2026-09-04T01:47:01.435548+00:00','2026-09-04T01:48:00.330462+00:00','image','导台2 道具转面三视图 · 购车合同',0,'e7828fd1-8b10-445e-999d-f4f308178a86',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-04T01:48:00.323750+00:00',NULL),('V8Phbntu0WlM','8UKOFV4-iyb37iqN','vace-video','failed','生成失败',0,'实拍文艺近景，女生站在驿站门口，纤长指尖轻触透明 AR 眼镜镜框@图1 ，镜片浮动细碎金色诗词光粒，背景虚化青瓦古巷与枝叶，清新治愈质感，画面干净无多余人群，浅景深，焦点落在眼镜。镜头柔和快速向前推进，丝滑柔化快推运镜，镜头穿透一侧的AR眼镜镜片，镜面流淌淡金色粒子特效转场，外部实景缓慢虚化褪去，朦胧水墨光斑过渡画面，轻薄数字光效，随后视线进入眼镜内部幻境空间，白帝城鸟瞰图@图2 ，叠加轻薄鎏金 AR 特效，AR特效缓飘动，镜头慢慢摇起，远景@图3 ，定格。','',NULL,'{}','{}',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164749_835c7bf1645ee8d4.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164752_f0eec4b1f50c1f6b.png\", \"zly-ai-video-studio/migrated-upload/20260831/164757_ee0d802eedf0c461.png\"]','[]','ComfyUI 推理失败: [