INSERT INTO `xiaji_beats` VALUES ('xjb-0075f42ea84042f7','xje-55592d30aa354653',3,'action','','','巷中饿晕的少年倒地，一只粗瓷碗递到面前——顾粲母亲的一碗白饭。｜字幕：「一饭之恩。」｜碗沿轻碰石阶。','巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。','[\"ast-6b31d06443504c6e\"]','ast-d030cd3768e44977','[\"ast-d1bcef7a5d8c49f9\"]','q9NsJjraOX5T','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260907/142047_ffe76ec55065961a.png','ROLE: You are a MASTER FILM DIRECTOR and storyboard artist. TASK: Draw ONE panel as a rushed film director storyboard scribble on cheap white paper. This is a blocking thumbnail, not a finished illustration. STYLE: loose pencil/marker doodle, imperfect strokes, deliberately unpolished, raw thumbnail-grade draft. Completely uninterested in artistic finish. WHITE PAPER BACKGROUND ONLY. No photographic production still, no cinematic lighting, no grayscale rendering, no gradients, no shadows, no material shading, no texture, no digital art, no vector clean-up. SYMBOLIC STORYBOARD PEOPLE ONLY: oval head, one spine line, single-stroke arms/legs, tiny facing ticks. NO clothing, no hair, no facial features, no skin, no realistic anatomy. SINGLE-MOMENT RULE: exactly one camera setup and one frozen story moment. No collage, split-screen, subtitles, watermark, or readable text. If a scene reference is attached, redraw it as sparse black/gray line art only. Do NOT copy realistic lighting, colors, texture, or rendered detail. World/setting cue only (do not render as a finished still): luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. CHARACTER COLOR MARKERS: 顾粲 = solid INDIGO fill #4F46E5 featureless mannequin. location 破屋内: simplified architectural line art only. 一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。. named prop 粗瓷碗: simple silhouette / marker shape, no material finish. ACTION (source of truth): 巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。. speaking, gesture only, no readable text: 巷中饿晕的少年倒地，一只粗瓷碗递到面前——顾粲母亲的一碗白饭。｜字幕：「一饭之恩。」｜碗沿轻碰石阶。','grs-gpt-image-2','succeeded',NULL,'QrosIDBWx5d','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260907/142235_3ea8d9110e4bf7bc.png','Render this sketch into a high-quality colored production still. Image 1 / SKETCH IS the base drawing — preserve ALL composition, crop, poses, and camera angles exactly. Other reference images lock identity only and must not change the sketch layout. After the sketch, character attachments are FACE then COSTUME for each named character in order. FACE locks identity; COSTUME locks clothing. Do not treat a costume sheet as the face. CRITICAL: Keep exact composition from sketch. Only add color, texture, and lighting. luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k. CHARACTERS (match face references): 顾粲 (sketch marker INDIGO #4F46E5) 男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型 顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。 顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。. SCENE: 破屋内. 一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。. prop 粗瓷碗: 一个普通的粗瓷碗，碗沿有轻微磕碰痕迹，颜色朴素，大小适中，象征着顾粲母亲的善意。. 巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。. speaking, silent acting, no readable text: 巷中饿晕的少年倒地，一只粗瓷碗递到面前——顾粲母亲的一碗白饭。｜字幕：「一饭之恩。」｜碗沿轻碰石阶。','grs-gpt-image-2','ZqZBp53vIgmS','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/minimax_h3/20260907/143055_2b93a629711af4f2.mp4','顾粲. Luxury product photography style with premium textures, elegant composition, high-end commercial aesthetics, clean background, emphasizing soft lighting and refined details. The visual is cinematic yet minimalist, blending modern urban elements with ancient rustic tones.\n\n<Picture 1>: Previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here, locking t=0 for the transition.\n<Picture 2>: Current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not final freeze, showing Gu Can collapsed faintly, a coarse ceramic bowl held out in front, its rim lightly tapping the stone step.\n<Picture 3>: Character portrait still of Gu Can; FACE identity lock only, emphasizing a lean, gentle-youth face.\n<Picture 4>: Costume still of Gu Can named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only, locking his simple, slightly pale attire.\n<Picture 5>: Front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only, focusing on the dilapidated indoor setting.\n\nTimed shot list for 10 seconds:\n0-1.5 seconds TRANSITION: Start from the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1>, continuously morphing to <Picture 2> with a slow lens zoom-in and rise, camera height from ground level to medium shot, light transitioning from shadowed to soft illumination, cloth details gently swaying, dust particles floating in the air as the focus shifts to Gu Can\'s body and the bowl.\nCUT 1 from 1.5 seconds: Fixed medium shot, eye-level height, stable lens, Gu Can collapsed with a faint, vacant expression, lips cracked showing desperation; the bowl slightly held out by an unseen figure, rim tapping the stone step with a subtle sound; cloth dynamics: Gu Can\'s simple clothes lightly fluttering in the breeze; environment reaction: light streaming through a window casts dust motes, background details static; focus shifts from Gu Can\'s face to the bowl for clarity.\nFrom 2.5 seconds TRANSITION: Add a gentle push-in shot from medium to close-up on the bowl, camera rising slightly, highlighting the approaching figure and the tap action; micro-acting: Gu Can\'s eyes slightly lift with a hint of gratitude; cloth dynamics: no change; environment reaction: dust settling, light softening; intensifies the same beat by focusing on the bowl\'s movement.\nCUT 2 from 4.5 seconds: Switch to close-up on the bowl, overhead low-angle shot, slight pan movement, emphasizing the rim tapping detail; Gu Can\'s head slightly raises, expression transitioning from despair to mild hope; cloth dynamics: attire remains static; environment reaction: light diffuses evenly, dust minimal; focus remains on the bowl\'s crisp animation.\nFrom 6.5 seconds HOLD: Maintain medium shot composition, camera stable, Gu Can\'s body trembling slightly, the figure steps back, bowl held steady; micro-acting: slight eye movement showing awareness; cloth dynamics: clothes undisturbed; environment reaction: indoor silence, light uniform; extends the beat with sustained observation.\nFrom 8.5 seconds TRANSITION: Camera slowly pulls out from close-up to wide-angle view of the alley, bowl vanishes, focus reverts to Gu Can\'s collapsed position; micro-acting: no emotional change; cloth dynamics: clothes settle; environment reaction: lingering dust, light fading subtly; concludes on a clear frame at 10 seconds, ensuring continuity with the beat.','minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','10','succeeded',NULL,'succeeded',NULL,'高端奢侈产品视觉风格，充满细腻奢华材质、优雅线条和柔和色彩，营造出现代都市与古风古装融合的高雅商业氛围，强调简洁背景和高端摄影质感。画面以细腻的光影和精致构图为主，突出人物与环境的互动。\n\n<Picture 1>：上一镜视频截图，锁定t=0，作为0-1.5秒过渡起点，展示上一镜结束时的场景。\n<Picture 2>：本镜精绘目标构图，约1.5秒到达，显示巷中顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶的完整画面。\n<Picture 3>：顾粲头像素材，锁定脸与身份，清瘦温和的少年脸庞。\n<Picture 4>：顾粲基础造型素材，锁定朴素服装，略显苍白面容，体现善良性格。\n<Picture 5>：破屋内环境素材，锁定破旧室内空间，压抑光线和周围元素。\n\n分镜详细描述（10秒）：\n0-1.5秒 TRANSITION：从<Picture 1>的上一镜截图连续过渡到<Picture 2>的本镜精绘构图，采用缓慢镜头拉近效果，机位从地面视角升至中景，焦点从环境元素逐渐转移到顾粲的身体和碗，光线柔和地从阴影中溢出，布料动态轻微飘动，环境尘土在空气中微扬。\nCUT 1 从1.5秒开始：固定机位为中景，高度眼线，镜头稳定，顾粲微微蜷缩倒地，脸庞沾着尘土，眼神无神微表情显示虚弱；递碗者（未指定）从左侧缓步靠近，粗瓷碗轻轻悬停在顾粲面前，碗沿在石阶上轻触发出细微声响；布料动态：顾粲的朴素衣裳随风轻微摆动；环境反应：破屋内光线从侧面窗户透入，尘埃在光束中悬浮；焦点变化：从顾粲脸部到碗的特写，保持清晰。\n从2.5秒 TRANSITION：添加轻微推镜头，从中景推向顾粲倒地的特写，机位略升，突出碗的递入动作，顾粲微张嘴呼吸急促；微表情：嘴唇干裂，眉头轻皱显示饥饿；布料动态：衣角随风拂动；环境反应：石阶尘土飞扬，光线从窗户斜射。\nCUT 2 从4.5秒开始：切换到碗的特写，机位从上方俯视，镜头轻微摇摄，显示碗沿轻碰石阶细节；顾粲头部微抬，眼神略显感激；布料动态：无直接影响；环境反应：光线柔和，尘土沉降；焦点保持碗的清晰。\n从6.5秒 HOLD：继续中景构图，机位稳定，顾粲身体轻微颤抖，递碗者退后一步，碗保持在原位；微表情：顾粲眼神从无神转为一丝希望；布料动态：衣裳静态；环境反应：破屋内寂静，光线均匀。\n从8.5秒 TRANSITION：机位缓缓拉远，从特写回到广角巷景，碗消失，焦点移至顾粲倒地全景；微表情：无变化；布料动态：衣裳保持原状；环境反应：尘土残留，光线渐暗；结束于顾粲倒地的静帧。','815e136ae81f4d5b','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/xiaji-in-frames/20260907/141858_465b996a45dbb38d.png',NULL,'icKjE7PIRdwd','0',NULL),('xjb-01983e7798a9453c','xje-0170df18dfe240c0',5,'action','','','','荣哥停下脚步，身体停止移动。','[\"ast-e7c4895576ec47e2\"]','ast-80895ad685ad41a8','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-02d10c2b95404817','xje-b1dcafbf565c45e3',11,'action','','','','邮轮甲板上，海风轻拂，栏杆旁有几处海水飞溅。','[]','ast-80895ad685ad41a8','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-07448fbd886f4df9','xje-f26380309b7d4018',6,'action','','','','药铺杨家的冷傲剑修少女宁姚出现，手持长剑。','[\"ast-64e10e176553447c\", \"ast-52b1dbdebd914c33\"]',NULL,'[\"ast-b2bf76555e874fa0\"]','WQeBVjKBUxVd',NULL,'Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. single cinematic storyboard still, one camera shot, photoreal production frame, no collage, no subtitles, no watermark. character 主角 男性，儿童，短发黑，小眼睛，苍白肤色，瘦削脸型 命运多舛的孤儿，失去修行机会后生活困苦，性格坚韧。 命运多舛的孤儿，失去修行机会后生活困苦，性格坚韧。. character 宁姚 女性，青年，黑色长发，冷冽眼睛，白皙肤色，瓜子脸 冷傲的剑修，与主角有约定，性格外冷内热。 冷傲的剑修，与主角有约定，性格外冷内热。. prop 长生桥: 一座古老的石桥，横跨在深渊之上，桥身刻有神秘符文，散发着淡淡的光芒。. 药铺杨家的冷傲剑修少女宁姚出现，手持长剑。','grs-gpt-image-2','failed','内容未通过审核（可能含真人等受限内容）：We are so sorry, but the prompt may violate our content policies. If you think we got it wrong, please retry or edit your prompt.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-0873b9e43a9948f9','xje-d15a6ac1266a48ac',9,'action','','','','刺客呼吸平稳，气息内敛。','[\"ast-7d985185148a4744\"]',NULL,'[\"ast-fbe6aa8917064d4b\", \"ast-a065f4864e0344a5\"]','c3udNlZH7eX',NULL,'ROLE: You are a MASTER FILM DIRECTOR and storyboard artist. TASK: Draw ONE panel as a rushed film director storyboard scribble on cheap 