loose pencil/marker doodle, imperfect strokes, deliberately unpolished, raw thumbnail-grade draft. Completely uninterested in artistic finish. WHITE PAPER BACKGROUND ONLY. No photographic production still, no cinematic lighting, no grayscale rendering, no gradients, no shadows, no material shading, no texture, no digital art, no vector clean-up. SYMBOLIC STORYBOARD PEOPLE ONLY: oval head, one spine line, single-stroke arms/legs, tiny facing ticks. NO clothing, no hair, no facial features, no skin, no realistic anatomy. SINGLE-MOMENT RULE: exactly one camera setup and one frozen story moment. No collage, split-screen, subtitles, watermark, or readable text. If a scene reference is attached, redraw it as sparse black/gray line art only. Do NOT copy realistic lighting, colors, texture, or rendered detail. World/setting cue only (do not render as a finished still). Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. CHARACTER COLOR MARKERS: 刺客 = solid INDIGO fill #4F46E5 featureless mannequin. named prop 刀: simple silhouette / marker shape, no material finish. ACTION (source of truth): 刺客身穿夜行紧身衣，身形精悍。','grs-gpt-image-2','failed','内容未通过审核（可能含真人等受限内容）：我可以根据你的提示词生成这张 2:3 比例的分镜草图，但当前图像生成请求未能执行成功。\n\n请重新发送一次生成请求（如果有参考图，请一并上传）；我会按以下要求生成：\n- 2:3 竖版比例\n- 白纸背景\n- 导演分镜速写风格\n- 黑/灰铅笔马克笔涂鸦线稿\n- 不做成品插画、不加光影材质\n- 刺客为靛蓝色（#4F46E5）无五官人偶标记\n- 单一镜头、单一动作瞬间\n- 不含字幕、水印、可读文字',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-dc024d548138435c','xje-f597bf89dd2242ef',1,'action','','','','夕阳洒在海面上，远处邮轮轮廓模糊。','[]','ast-cbc8d63bad75468d','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-dc195bcc23854de8','xje-f597bf89dd2242ef',4,'action','','','','邮轮甲板上的游客在移动','[]','ast-cbc8d63bad75468d','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-dc7d503f84304fb2','xje-f597bf89dd2242ef',9,'action','','','海浪声、海风声、游客交谈声。','海浪拍打沙滩，海风吹皱远处的水面，隐约可见几个游客在海边交谈。','[]','ast-cbc8d63bad75468d','[]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-dcd15795cd9c47f0','xje-0170df18dfe240c0',1,'action','','','','荣哥保持着优雅的姿势，手中稳稳地托着一个精致的纸箱。','[\"ast-e7c4895576ec47e2\"]',NULL,'[\"ast-3bb92e742deb4235\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-fbe3e5dc0d5e4f1d','xje-fac7e608fed748dc',1,'action','','','骊珠洞天即将崩塌，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人 殉道身陨，临终留下机缘与遗愿。','骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗','[\"ast-a354f94a131c4ff8\", \"ast-a19fd21df61346e3\"]','ast-a3ac769d8ee546bd','[]','Bfgxg55quZ7r','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260904/145001_722431b11425e6a9.png','ROLE: You are a MASTER FILM DIRECTOR and storyboard artist. TASK: Draw ONE panel as a rushed film director storyboard scribble on cheap white paper. This is a blocking thumbnail, not a finished illustration. STYLE: loose pencil/marker doodle, imperfect strokes, deliberately unpolished, raw thumbnail-grade draft. Completely uninterested in artistic finish. WHITE PAPER BACKGROUND ONLY. No photographic production still, no cinematic lighting, no grayscale rendering, no gradients, no shadows, no material shading, no texture, no digital art, no vector clean-up. SYMBOLIC STORYBOARD PEOPLE ONLY: oval head, one spine line, single-stroke arms/legs, tiny facing ticks. NO clothing, no hair, no facial features, no skin, no realistic anatomy. SINGLE-MOMENT RULE: exactly one camera setup and one frozen story moment. No collage, split-screen, subtitles, watermark, or readable text. If a scene reference is attached, redraw it as sparse black/gray line art only. Do NOT copy realistic lighting, colors, texture, or rendered detail. World/setting cue only (do not render as a finished still). Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. CHARACTER COLOR MARKERS: 齐静春 = solid VIOLET fill #7C3AED featureless mannequin; 陈平安 = solid AMBER fill #D97706 featureless mannequin. location 骊珠洞天: simplified architectural line art only. 一个即将崩塌的神秘洞天，周围是小镇和百姓，环境险峻，危机四伏。. ACTION (source of truth): 骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗. speaking, gesture only, no readable text: 骊珠洞天即将崩塌，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人 殉道身陨，临终留下机缘与遗愿。','grs-gpt-image-2','succeeded',NULL,'QhCL3nBCEcUn','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/image/20260904/145836_038e09c80766f53a.png','Render this sketch into a high-quality colored production still. Image 1 / SKETCH IS the base drawing — preserve ALL composition, crop, poses, and camera angles exactly. Other reference images lock identity only and must not change the sketch layout. After the sketch, character attachments are FACE then COSTUME for each named character in order. FACE locks identity; COSTUME locks clothing. Do not treat a costume sheet as the face. CRITICAL: Keep exact composition from sketch. Only add color, texture, and lighting. Default ethnicity for people in this image: Chinese. If the character description already names another origin, follow that description. Cinematic lighting, photorealistic, 8k. CHARACTERS (match face references): 齐静春 (sketch marker VIOLET #7C3AED) 男性，middle，黑色短发，灰色眼睛，中等肤色，方脸; 陈平安 (sketch marker AMBER #D97706) 男性，youth，黑色短发，蓝色眼睛，普通肤色，圆脸. SCENE: 骊珠洞天. 一个即将崩塌的神秘洞天，周围是小镇和百姓，环境险峻，危机四伏。. 骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗. speaking, silent acting, no readable text: 骊珠洞天即将崩塌，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人 殉道身陨，临终留下机缘与遗愿。','grs-gpt-image-2','204FPzjSEvYd','https://img.zlyun168.com/zly-ai-video-studio/minimax_h3/20260904/150808_e9ef41244090ff4d.mp4','Cinematic realistic period-drama lighting, keep continuity with the first frame. Use <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep composition. Use <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 齐静春; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 骊珠洞天; space lock only. Action chain for 5 seconds: From 0.00 to 1.50 seconds: Start from exact composition of <Picture 1>, camera follows initial fight and collapse beginning. From 1.50 to 5.00 seconds: Collapse intensifies, 齐静春 sacrifices himself to protect the town, ending with the scene.','minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v','5','succeeded',NULL,'succeeded',NULL,'视觉风格：写实电影感，光影连续，营造史诗战斗氛围。参考图：使用<Picture 1>锁定t=0构图、机位和站位；使用<Picture 2>锁定齐静春头像，仅锁脸与身份；使用<Picture 3>锁定陈平安头像，仅锁脸与身份；使用<Picture 4>锁定骊珠洞天环境，仅锁空间。画面解说：这段就是5秒。0-1.5秒：镜头保持<Picture 1>构图，展示齐静春和陈平安在骊珠洞天战斗起始，崩塌效果开始显现，运镜稳定跟随人物动作。1.5-5秒：崩塌加剧，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人身体前倾阻挡，最终殉道身陨，镜头展现英雄气概和环境毁灭。','cb253bf882ab4bd7',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('xjb-fd3f4ec000a64469','xje-b1dcafbf565c45e3',9,'action','','','','远景展示邮轮甲板，镜头跟随荣哥背后移动，切换荣哥正面近景，特写纸箱。','[\"ast-e7c4895576ec47e2\"]','ast-80895ad685ad41a8','[\"ast-3bb92e742deb4235\"]',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
