衔接帧（bridge_in）：<Picture 1> 永远是上一镜截图。<Picture 2> 才是本镜精绘。必须写 0-1.5s 从衔接帧连续过渡到本镜精绘构图；1.5s 之后才按本镜动作向前演。禁止硬切、分屏、拼贴。\\n6. 若没有衔接帧：<Picture 1> 是本镜精绘首帧，机位与站位以它为 t=0，只能向前演。\\n7. 头像只锁脸和身份；造型图只锁服装；场景图只锁环境。不能改掉 t=0 或 1.5s 目标布局。\\n8. 动画/国漫/漫画风才允许 comic lettering、速度线、墨点溅射，且必须与对白节奏同步。写实古装/真人风禁止漫画大字和字幕条。任何风格都不要写 <Audio n>，本机不传音频。\\n9. 只根据本镜动作、对白、参考图来写。禁止抄屋顶小超人、机甲咆哮、GET READY TO MEET YOUR MAKER 等外来示例。\\n10. 只输出 JSON。\", \"user_prompt\": \"工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\\n模式：r2v\\n指定时长：10 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 10 秒，并按 CUT/TRANSITION/HOLD 写满整段。\\n密度：英文稿至少 220 词，中文稿至少 280 字。要有运镜、微表情、布料、环境反应，不要摘要。\\n画风代码：as_1002\\n画风：奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background\\n字效规则：写实/真人画风：禁止漫画大字、花字、字幕条；对白只靠口型和身体表演。\\n镜头标头：（无）\\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事，禁止改写成别的故事）：少年怀抱陶罐站在巷口，被推搡在地，对众人拱手。\\n说话人：（无）\\n对白：（无）\\n衔接：需要 0-1.5s 从上一镜截图过渡到本镜精绘\\n\\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\\n<Picture 1>\\n- 素材类型: previous_last_frame\\n- 素材专名: 上一镜衔接帧\\n- 中文职责: 上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点\\n- English lock: previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here\\n- 素材细节: 素材=上一镜视频截图（默认末帧，可手动改截）；职责=锁定 t=0，0-1.5s 必须从此帧连续过渡到本镜精绘\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=previous shot video screenshot；DUTY=lock t=0; 0-1.5s must transform into the current render\\n\\n<Picture 2>\\n- 素材类型: shot_render\\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘\\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘，约 1.5 秒到达的构图，不是全片结尾静帧\\n- English lock: current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue\\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘目标构图（约 1.5 秒到达，不是全片结尾）；动作=少年怀抱陶罐站在巷口，被推搡在地，对众人拱手。；出场=顾粲；场景=破屋内；职责=1.5s 到达此构图，之后从这里按本镜动作向前演\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not the final freeze；ACTION=少年怀抱陶罐站在巷口，被推搡在地，对众人拱手。；CAST=顾粲；PLACE=破屋内；DUTY=arrive here by 1.5s then continue the beat action\\n\\n<Picture 3>\\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\\n- 素材专名: 顾粲\\n- 中文职责: 顾粲 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\\n- English lock: character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=顾粲；身份=少年；男；youth；清瘦，眼神温和；外貌=男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=顾粲；IDENTITY=少年；男；youth；清瘦，眼神温和；APPEARANCE=男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型；DUTY=lock face and identity only\\n\\n<Picture 4>\\n- 素材类型: character_costume\\n- 素材专名: 顾粲·基础造型\\n- 中文职责: 顾粲 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装\\n- English lock: costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色造型图；人物=顾粲；造型名=基础造型；服装=顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。；职责=只锁定服装与体态，不得改首帧站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character costume / turnaround；SUBJECT=顾粲；LOOK=基础造型；COSTUME=顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。；DUTY=lock clothing only\\n\\n<Picture 5>\\n- 素材类型: scene_plate\\n- 素材专名: 破屋内\\n- 中文职责: 场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间\\n- English lock: front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=场景正面环境图；场景=破屋内；环境=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；职责=只锁定空间与光线，不得改首帧人物站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=scene front plate；PLACE=破屋内；ENVIRONMENT=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；DUTY=lock environment only\\n\\n英文稿骨架（只学分镜写法的密度和 CUT 结构；锁图句换成上面清单里的专名；动作只写本镜，禁止抄屋顶超人/机甲/YOUR MAKER）：\\n奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity: 0-1.5s bridge from previous last frame into the current render, then play this beat.\\nUse <Picture 1> as previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here.\\nUse <Picture 2> as current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue.\\nUse <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\nUse <Picture 5> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nTimed shot list for 10 seconds (write every beat of action, do not summarize):\\n0-1.5s TRANSITION: start FROM the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1> (previous shot screenshot) and continuously transform into the current beat render <Picture 2>. No hard cut, no split screen. Describe how space, faces, and camera morph.\\nCUT 1 from 1.5s: continue FROM <Picture 2>. Name the visible people and place. Write camera (height, lens feel, move), micro-acting, cloth, light, and environment reaction.\\nIf 10s still has room after CUT 1, add TRANSITION + CUT 2 that intensifies THE SAME beat (new angle or closer, not a new plot).\\nHOLD through 10s. End on a concrete frame, not a generic fade.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No lower-third subtitle bar.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"用 <Picture 3> 作为顾粲 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份。 用 <Picture 4> 作为顾粲 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装。 用 <Picture 5> 作为场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间。\\n奢侈产品视觉风格，高端商业摄影质感，通透洁净的布景氛围，黑白色调为主，略带柔光质感，干净利落的剪影勾勒，少年顾粲身处破旧与精致交织的环境。参考图精准锁定所有视觉元素，不得改动。\\n\\n<Picture 1> 是上一镜视频截图，画面中顾粲怀抱陶罐站在破屋内，气氛压抑，光线昏暗。镜头从这里开始，0-1.5秒镜头逐渐拉远，机位升高，背景虚化，光线从侧面注入，照亮陶罐的细节，同时顾粲的表情从困惑变为警觉。\\n\\n<Picture 2> 是本镜精绘，约1.5秒达到构图，顾粲被人群推搡在地，陶罐脱手滚落，他仍保持拱手姿势，眼神温和但坚定。场景是破屋内，光线从窗户斜射，形成戏剧性光影。\\n\\nCUT 1 (0-1.5秒)：从<Picture 1>开始，镜头缓慢拉远，机位从低角度提升至水平，背景由模糊的人声变为窗外斜射的光线，照亮破屋内顾粲的面部，他的眼神从困惑转为警觉，嘴角微微上扬。\\n\\nCUT 2 (1.5-5秒)：固定镜头，机位略高于地面，拉镜头向前，展现顾粲被推搡的过程，他的衣服被风掀起，布料动态明显，陶罐脱手滚落，他仍保持拱手，眼神含泪但嘴角上扬，背景中有轻微的风声呼啸，尘土扬起，光线在地面形成影子。\\n\\nCUT 3 (5-10秒)：推镜头向前，机位从侧面逼近顾粲，镜头聚焦在他的面部，光线从背后射入，形成轮廓光，他的微表情从温和转为坚强，嘴角微微上扬，眼神坚定，同时背景光线逐渐增强，照亮整个场景。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Use <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 4> as costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only. Use <Picture 5> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nLuxury product visual style, high-end commercial photography aesthetic, translucent and clean scene atmosphere, mainly monochrome tones with a slight soft texture, sharp silhouettes outlining cleanly, Gu Can standing in an environment that blends decay and elegance. Referenced images lock all visual elements precisely, no changes allowed.\\n\\n<Picture 1> is the last frame of the previous shot, showing Gu Can holding a pottery jar standing in a dilapidated house, a tense atmosphere with dim lighting. The shot begins here from 0-1.5 seconds, lens moves gradually pulling away, height rising, background blurring, light coming from the side to illuminate the pottery jar\'s details, while Gu Can\'s expression shifts from confusion to alertness.\\n\\n<Picture 2> is the current beat render, achieving the composition by 1.5 seconds, Gu Can being shoved to the ground, the jar falling out of his grasp, yet still bowing his hand, his eyes gentle but firm. The scene is inside a dilapidated house, light coming from a window at an angle creating dramatic shadows.\\n\\nCUT 1 (0-1.5s): Start from <Picture 1>, lens slowly pulling away, shot height rising from low to eye level, background blurring from indistinct human voices to light coming in from the window, illuminating Gu Can\'s face, his expression shifting from confusion to alert, lips slightly upturned.\\n\\nCUT 2 (1.5-5s): Fixed lens, shot height slightly above ground, dollying forward, showing the process of being shoved, his clothes being lifted by wind, cloth dynamics prominent, the jar falling, yet he maintains the bowing posture, his expression contains tears but a slight smile, lips subtly raised, eyes determined, background has a faint wind sound, dust rising, light falling on the floor creating shadows.\\n\\nCUT 3 (5-10s): Pushing lens forward, shot moving from the side to focus on Gu Can\'s face, light coming from behind creating a rim light, his micro-expression shifts from gentle to resolute, lips slightly upturned, eyes firm, background light gradually intensifies, illuminating the entire scene.\"}}','{\"prompt_zh\": \"用 <Picture 3> 作为顾粲 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份。 用 <Picture 4> 作为顾粲 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装。 用 <Picture 5> 作为场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间。\\n奢侈产品视觉风格，高端商业摄影质感，通透洁净的布景氛围，黑白色调为主，略带柔光质感，干净利落的剪影勾勒，少年顾粲身处破旧与精致交织的环境。参考图精准锁定所有视觉元素，不得改动。\\n\\n<Picture 1> 是上一镜视频截图，画面中顾粲怀抱陶罐站在破屋内，气氛压抑，光线昏暗。镜头从这里开始，0-1.5秒镜头逐渐拉远，机位升高，背景虚化，光线从侧面注入，照亮陶罐的细节，同时顾粲的表情从困惑变为警觉。\\n\\n<Picture 2> 是本镜精绘，约1.5秒达到构图，顾粲被人群推搡在地，陶罐脱手滚落，他仍保持拱手姿势，眼神温和但坚定。场景是破屋内，光线从窗户斜射，形成戏剧性光影。\\n\\nCUT 1 (0-1.5秒)：从<Picture 1>开始，镜头缓慢拉远，机位从低角度提升至水平，背景由模糊的人声变为窗外斜射的光线，照亮破屋内顾粲的面部，他的眼神从困惑转为警觉，嘴角微微上扬。\\n\\nCUT 2 (1.5-5秒)：固定镜头，机位略高于地面，拉镜头向前，展现顾粲被推搡的过程，他的衣服被风掀起，布料动态明显，陶罐脱手滚落，他仍保持拱手，眼神含泪但嘴角上扬，背景中有轻微的风声呼啸，尘土扬起，光线在地面形成影子。\\n\\nCUT 3 (5-10秒)：推镜头向前，机位从侧面逼近顾粲，镜头聚焦在他的面部，光线从背后射入，形成轮廓光，他的微表情从温和转为坚强，嘴角微微上扬，眼神坚定，同时背景光线逐渐增强，照亮整个场景。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Use <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 4> as costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only. Use <Picture 5> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nLuxury product visual style, high-end commercial photography aesthetic, translucent and clean scene atmosphere, mainly monochrome tones with a slight soft texture, sharp silhouettes outlining cleanly, Gu Can standing in an environment that blends decay and elegance. Referenced images lock all visual elements precisely, no changes allowed.\\n\\n<Picture 1> is the last frame of the previous shot, showing Gu Can holding a pottery jar standing in a dilapidated house, a tense atmosphere with dim lighting. The shot begins here from 0-1.5 seconds, lens moves gradually pulling away, height rising, background blurring, light coming from the side to illuminate the pottery jar\'s details, while Gu Can\'s expression shifts from confusion to alertness.\\n\\n<Picture 2> is the current beat render, achieving the composition by 1.5 seconds, Gu Can being shoved to the ground, the jar falling out of his grasp, yet still bowing his hand, his eyes gentle but firm. The scene is inside a dilapidated house, light coming from a window at an angle creating dramatic shadows.\\n\\nCUT 1 (0-1.5s): Start from <Picture 1>, lens slowly pulling away, shot height rising from low to eye level, background blurring from indistinct human voices to light coming in from the window, illuminating Gu Can\'s face, his expression shifting from confusion to alert, lips slightly upturned.\\n\\nCUT 2 (1.5-5s): Fixed lens, shot height slightly above ground, dollying forward, showing the process of being shoved, his clothes being lifted by wind, cloth dynamics prominent, the jar falling, yet he maintains the bowing posture, his expression contains tears but a slight smile, lips subtly raised, eyes determined, background has a faint wind sound, dust rising, light falling on the floor creating shadows.\\n\\nCUT 3 (5-10s): Pushing lens forward, shot moving from the side to focus on Gu Can\'s face, light coming from behind creating a rim light, his micro-expression shifts from gentle to resolute, lips slightly upturned, eyes firm, background light gradually intensifies, illuminating the entire scene.\"}',NULL,'2026-09-07T06:10:34.838467+00:00','2026-09-07T06:11:41.005853+00:00'),('77c29410f76c41a0','fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm','xjp-22a12dd8c5aa4aaf','video_prompt','第1集 · 镜头 3','镜头视频提示词 · 第1集 · 镜头 3','succeeded',100,'deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B','工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\n模式：r2v\n指定时长：5 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 5 秒。\n视觉风格代码：（未设）\n视觉风格：跟随项目设定，写实电影感，不要强行漫画字效\n镜头标头：（无）\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事）：齐静春虚弱地站立，剑气微弱。\n说话人：齐静春\n对白：陈平安，保护好百姓。\n衔接：需要 0-1.5s 从上一镜截图过渡到本镜精绘\n\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\n<Picture 1>\n- 素材类型: previous_last_frame\n- 素材专名: 上一镜衔接帧\n- 中文职责: 上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点\n- English lock: previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here\n- 素材细节: 素材=上一镜视频截图（默认末帧，可手动改截）；职责=锁定 t=0，0-1.5s 必须从此帧连续过渡到本镜精绘\n- material detail: MATERIAL=previous shot video screenshot；DUTY=lock t=0; 0-1.5s must transform into the current render\n\n<Picture 2>\n- 素材类型: shot_render\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘，约 1.5 秒到达的构图，不是全片结尾静帧\n- English lock: current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘目标构图（约 1.5 秒到达，不是全片结尾）；动作=齐静春虚弱地站立，剑气微弱。；出场=齐静春、陈平安；场景=骊珠洞天；职责=1.5s 到达此构图，之后从这里按本镜动作向前演\n- material detail: MATERIAL=current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not the final freeze；ACTION=齐静春虚弱地站立，剑气微弱。；CAST=齐静春, 陈平安；PLACE=骊珠洞天；DUTY=arrive here by 1.5s then conti