background\\n字效规则：写实/真人画风：禁止漫画大字、花字、字幕条；对白只靠口型和身体表演。\\n镜头标头：（无）\\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事，禁止改写成别的故事）：巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。\\n说话人：（无）\\n对白：巷中饿晕的少年倒地，一只粗瓷碗递到面前——顾粲母亲的一碗白饭。｜字幕：「一饭之恩。」｜碗沿轻碰石阶。\\n衔接：需要 0-1.5s 从上一镜截图过渡到本镜精绘\\n\\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\\n<Picture 1>\\n- 素材类型: previous_last_frame\\n- 素材专名: 上一镜衔接帧\\n- 中文职责: 上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点\\n- English lock: previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here\\n- 素材细节: 素材=上一镜视频截图（默认末帧，可手动改截）；职责=锁定 t=0，0-1.5s 必须从此帧连续过渡到本镜精绘\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=previous shot video screenshot；DUTY=lock t=0; 0-1.5s must transform into the current render\\n\\n<Picture 2>\\n- 素材类型: shot_render\\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘\\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘，约 1.5 秒到达的构图，不是全片结尾静帧\\n- English lock: current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue\\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘目标构图（约 1.5 秒到达，不是全片结尾）；动作=巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。；出场=顾粲；场景=破屋内；职责=1.5s 到达此构图，之后从这里按本镜动作向前演\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not the final freeze；ACTION=巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。；CAST=顾粲；PLACE=破屋内；DUTY=arrive here by 1.5s then continue the beat action\\n\\n<Picture 3>\\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\\n- 素材专名: 顾粲\\n- 中文职责: 顾粲 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\\n- English lock: character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=顾粲；身份=少年；男；youth；清瘦，眼神温和；外貌=男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=顾粲；IDENTITY=少年；男；youth；清瘦，眼神温和；APPEARANCE=男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型；DUTY=lock face and identity only\\n\\n<Picture 4>\\n- 素材类型: character_costume\\n- 素材专名: 顾粲·基础造型\\n- 中文职责: 顾粲 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装\\n- English lock: costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色造型图；人物=顾粲；造型名=基础造型；服装=顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。；职责=只锁定服装与体态，不得改首帧站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character costume / turnaround；SUBJECT=顾粲；LOOK=基础造型；COSTUME=顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。；DUTY=lock clothing only\\n\\n<Picture 5>\\n- 素材类型: scene_plate\\n- 素材专名: 破屋内\\n- 中文职责: 场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间\\n- English lock: front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=场景正面环境图；场景=破屋内；环境=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；职责=只锁定空间与光线，不得改首帧人物站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=scene front plate；PLACE=破屋内；ENVIRONMENT=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；DUTY=lock environment only\\n\\n英文稿骨架（只学分镜写法的密度和 CUT 结构；锁图句换成上面清单里的专名；动作只写本镜，禁止抄屋顶超人/机甲/YOUR MAKER）：\\n奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity: 0-1.5s bridge from previous last frame into the current render, then play this beat.\\nUse <Picture 1> as previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here.\\nUse <Picture 2> as current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue.\\nUse <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\nUse <Picture 5> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nTimed shot list for 10 seconds (write every beat of action, do not summarize):\\n0-1.5s TRANSITION: start FROM the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1> (previous shot screenshot) and continuously transform into the current beat render <Picture 2>. No hard cut, no split screen. Describe how space, faces, and camera morph.\\nCUT 1 from 1.5s: continue FROM <Picture 2>. Name the visible people and place. Write camera (height, lens feel, move), micro-acting, cloth, light, and environment reaction.\\nIf 10s still has room after CUT 1, add TRANSITION + CUT 2 that intensifies THE SAME beat (new angle or closer, not a new plot).\\nHOLD through 10s. End on a concrete frame, not a generic fade.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No lower-third subtitle bar.\"}], \"system_prompt\": \"你是 LightX2V 多参考 R2V（MiniMax H3 Ref2V）运动导演。只输出一个 JSON 对象，不要 Markdown。\\nJSON 字段：\\n- prompt_zh: 给创作者看的中文镜头说明书，必须写满、写细，能直接当分镜导演阐述\\n- prompt_en: 交给本机 ComfyUI / LightX2V 的英文提示词，必须同样细，像完整 shot list\\n\\n密度要求（必须达到）：\\n- prompt_en 不少于 220 个英文单词；prompt_zh 不少于 280 个汉字。\\n- 禁止写成两三句摘要。必须按时间轴写完指定秒数里的每一段画面。\\n- 每一段都要写清：机位与运镜（推/拉/摇/升/降/环绕/whip 等）、人物微表情与肢体、服装布料动态、环境反应（尘土、窗、灯、风）、光线与焦点变化。\\n- 有对白时写口型、停顿、重音和身体如何配合这句话。\\n\\n结构（只学结构，禁止抄示例情节）：\\n1. 开场 1–2 句锁项目画风（材质、线、色板、时代/媒介），不要空喊 cinematic。\\n2. 逐张锁参考图必须写在正文最前面：中英都必须原样使用 <Picture 1>、<Picture 2>… 不得改写、跳号、省略。即使后面 CUT 写得很长，也绝不能漏掉任何一张。\\n3. 每一句 Use <Picture n> 必须写清素材类型和素材专名（角色名+头像/哪套造型，或场景名+正面/背面，或本镜精绘，或上一镜衔接帧）。禁止 the hero / a man / the second character。\\n4. 然后用 CUT 1 / TRANSITION / CUT 2 / HOLD 这种分镜写法覆盖整段时长。秒数不够就 CUT 1 + HOLD；秒数够就加第二机位或加 reverse，但必须仍是同一 Beat 的动作，不能另编一条新剧情。\\n5. 若有上一镜衔接帧（bridge_in）：<Picture 1> 永远是上一镜截图。<Picture 2> 才是本镜精绘。必须写 0-1.5s 从衔接帧连续过渡到本镜精绘构图；1.5s 之后才按本镜动作向前演。禁止硬切、分屏、拼贴。\\n6. 若没有衔接帧：<Picture 1> 是本镜精绘首帧，机位与站位以它为 t=0，只能向前演。\\n7. 头像只锁脸和身份；造型图只锁服装；场景图只锁环境。不能改掉 t=0 或 1.5s 目标布局。\\n8. 动画/国漫/漫画风才允许 comic lettering、速度线、墨点溅射，且必须与对白节奏同步。写实古装/真人风禁止漫画大字和字幕条。任何风格都不要写 <Audio n>，本机不传音频。\\n9. 只根据本镜动作、对白、参考图来写。禁止抄屋顶小超人、机甲咆哮、GET READY TO MEET YOUR MAKER 等外来示例。\\n10. 只输出 JSON。\", \"user_prompt\": \"工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\\n模式：r2v\\n指定时长：10 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 10 秒，并按 CUT/TRANSITION/HOLD 写满整段。\\n密度：英文稿至少 220 词，中文稿至少 280 字。要有运镜、微表情、布料、环境反应，不要摘要。\\n画风代码：as_1002\\n画风：奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background\\n字效规则：写实/真人画风：禁止漫画大字、花字、字幕条；对白只靠口型和身体表演。\\n镜头标头：（无）\\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事，禁止改写成别的故事）：巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。\\n说话人：（无）\\n对白：巷中饿晕的少年倒地，一只粗瓷碗递到面前——顾粲母亲的一碗白饭。｜字幕：「一饭之恩。」｜碗沿轻碰石阶。\\n衔接：需要 0-1.5s 从上一镜截图过渡到本镜精绘\\n\\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\\n<Picture 1>\\n- 素材类型: previous_last_frame\\n- 素材专名: 上一镜衔接帧\\n- 中文职责: 上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点\\n- English lock: previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here\\n- 素材细节: 素材=上一镜视频截图（默认末帧，可手动改截）；职责=锁定 t=0，0-1.5s 必须从此帧连续过渡到本镜精绘\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=previous shot video screenshot；DUTY=lock t=0; 0-1.5s must transform into the current render\\n\\n<Picture 2>\\n- 素材类型: shot_render\\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘\\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘，约 1.5 秒到达的构图，不是全片结尾静帧\\n- English lock: current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue\\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘目标构图（约 1.5 秒到达，不是全片结尾）；动作=巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。；出场=顾粲；场景=破屋内；职责=1.5s 到达此构图，之后从这里按本镜动作向前演\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not the final freeze；ACTION=巷中，顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶。；CAST=顾粲；PLACE=破屋内；DUTY=arrive here by 1.5s then continue the beat action\\n\\n<Picture 3>\\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\\n- 素材专名: 顾粲\\n- 中文职责: 顾粲 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\\n- English lock: character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=顾粲；身份=少年；男；youth；清瘦，眼神温和；外貌=男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=顾粲；IDENTITY=少年；男；youth；清瘦，眼神温和；APPEARANCE=男性，二十多岁，黑色短发，深邃眼睛，温和肤色，修长脸型；DUTY=lock face and identity only\\n\\n<Picture 4>\\n- 素材类型: character_costume\\n- 素材专名: 顾粲·基础造型\\n- 中文职责: 顾粲 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装\\n- English lock: costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色造型图；人物=顾粲；造型名=基础造型；服装=顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。；职责=只锁定服装与体态，不得改首帧站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character costume / turnaround；SUBJECT=顾粲；LOOK=基础造型；COSTUME=顾粲是巷中少年，性格善良，见陈平安饥饿，主动给予帮助。他有着关切的眼神，略显苍白的面容，穿着朴素的衣裳。；DUTY=lock clothing only\\n\\n<Picture 5>\\n- 素材类型: scene_plate\\n- 素材专名: 破屋内\\n- 中文职责: 场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间\\n- English lock: front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=场景正面环境图；场景=破屋内；环境=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；职责=只锁定空间与光线，不得改首帧人物站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=scene front plate；PLACE=破屋内；ENVIRONMENT=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；DUTY=lock environment only\\n\\n英文稿骨架（只学分镜写法的密度和 CUT 结构；锁图句换成上面清单里的专名；动作只写本镜，禁止抄屋顶超人/机甲/YOUR MAKER）：\\n奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity: 0-1.5s bridge from previous last frame into the current render, then play this beat.\\nUse <Picture 1> as previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here.\\nUse <Picture 2> as current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue.\\nUse <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 顾粲; FACE identity lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as costume still of 顾粲 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\nUse <Picture 5> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nTimed shot list for 10 seconds (write every beat of action, do not summarize):\\n0-1.5s TRANSITION: start FROM the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1> (previous shot screenshot) and continuously transform into the current beat render <Picture 2>. No hard cut, no split screen. Describe how space, faces, and camera morph.\\nCUT 1 from 1.5s: continue FROM <Picture 2>. Name the visible people and place. Write camera (height, lens feel, move), micro-acting, cloth, light, and environment reaction.\\nIf 10s still has room after CUT 1, add TRANSITION + CUT 2 that intensifies THE SAME beat (new angle or closer, not a new plot).\\nHOLD through 10s. End on a concrete frame, not a generic fade.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No lower-third subtitle bar.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"高端奢侈产品视觉风格，充满细腻奢华材质、优雅线条和柔和色彩，营造出现代都市与古风古装融合的高雅商业氛围，强调简洁背景和高端摄影质感。画面以细腻的光影和精致构图为主，突出人物与环境的互动。\\n\\n<Picture 1>：上一镜视频截图，锁定t=0，作为0-1.5秒过渡起点，展示上一镜结束时的场景。\\n<Picture 2>：本镜精绘目标构图，约1.5秒到达，显示巷中顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶的完整画面。\\n<Picture 3>：顾粲头像素材，锁定脸与身份，清瘦温和的少年脸庞。\\n<Picture 4>：顾粲基础造型素材，锁定朴素服装，略显苍白面容，体现善良性格。\\n<Picture 5>：破屋内环境素材，锁定破旧室内空间，压抑光线和周围元素。\\n\\n分镜详细描述（10秒）：\\n0-1.5秒 TRANSITION：从<Picture 1>的上一镜截图连续过渡到<Picture 2>的本镜精绘构图，采用缓慢镜头拉近效果，机位从地面视角升至中景，焦点从环境元素逐渐转移到顾粲的身体和碗，光线柔和地从阴影中溢出，布料动态轻微飘动，环境尘土在空气中微扬。\\nCUT 1 从1.5秒开始：固定机位为中景，高度眼线，镜头稳定，顾粲微微蜷缩倒地，脸庞沾着尘土，眼神无神微表情显示虚弱；递碗者（未指定）从左侧缓步靠近，粗瓷碗轻轻悬停在顾粲面前，碗沿在石阶上轻触发出细微声响；布料动态：顾粲的朴素衣裳随风轻微摆动；环境反应：破屋内光线从侧面窗户透入，尘埃在光束中悬浮；焦点变化：从顾粲脸部到碗的特写，保持清晰。\\n从2.5秒 TRANSITION：添加轻微推镜头，从中景推向顾粲倒地的特写，机位略升，突出碗的递入动作，顾粲微张嘴呼吸急促；微表情：嘴唇干裂，眉头轻皱显示饥饿；布料动态：衣角随风拂动；环境反应：石阶尘土飞扬，光线从窗户斜射。\\nCUT 2 从4.5秒开始：切换到碗的特写，机位从上方俯视，镜头轻微摇摄，显示碗沿轻碰石阶细节；顾粲头部微抬，眼神略显感激；布料动态：无直接影响；环境反应：光线柔和，尘土沉降；焦点保持碗的清晰。\\n从6.5秒 HOLD：继续中景构图，机位稳定，顾粲身体轻微颤抖，递碗者退后一步，碗保持在原位；微表情：顾粲眼神从无神转为一丝希望；布料动态：衣裳静态；环境反应：破屋内寂静，光线均匀。\\n从8.5秒 TRANSITION：机位缓缓拉远，从特写回到广角巷景，碗消失，焦点移至顾粲倒地全景；微表情：无变化；布料动态：衣裳保持原状；环境反应：尘土残留，光线渐暗；结束于顾粲倒地的静帧。\", \"prompt_en\": \"顾粲. Luxury product photography style with premium textures, elegant composition, high-end commercial aesthetics, clean background, emphasizing soft lighting and refined details. The visual is cinematic yet minimalist, blending modern urban elements with ancient rustic tones.\\n\\n<Picture 1>: Previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here, locking t=0 for the transition.\\n<Picture 2>: Current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not final freeze, showing Gu Can collapsed faintly, a coarse ceramic bowl held out in front, its rim lightly tapping the stone step.\\n<Picture 3>: Character portrait still of Gu Can; FACE identity lock only, emphasizing a lean, gentle-youth face.\\n<Picture 4>: Costume still of Gu Can named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only, locking his simple, slightly pale attire.\\n<Picture 5>: Front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only, focusing on the dilapidated indoor setting.\\n\\nTimed shot list for 10 seconds:\\n0-1.5 seconds TRANSITION: Start from the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1>, continuously morphing to <Picture 2> with a slow lens zoom-in and rise, camera height from ground level to medium shot, light transitioning from shadowed to soft illumination, cloth details gently swaying, dust particles floating in the air as the focus shifts to Gu Can\'s body and the bowl.\\nCUT 1 from 1.5 seconds: Fixed medium shot, eye-level height, stable lens, Gu Can collapsed with a faint, vacant expression, lips cracked showing desperation; the bowl slightly held out by an unseen figure, rim tapping the stone step with a subtle sound; cloth dynamics: Gu Can\'s simple clothes lightly fluttering in the breeze; environment reaction: light streaming through a window casts dust motes, background details static; focus shifts from Gu Can\'s face to the bowl for clarity.\\nFrom 2.5 seconds TRANSITION: Add a gentle push-in shot from medium to close-up on the bowl, camera rising slightly, highlighting the approaching figure and the tap action; micro-acting: Gu Can\'s eyes slightly lift with a hint of gratitude; cloth dynamics: no change; environment reaction: dust settling, light softening; intensifies the same beat by focusing on the bowl\'s movement.\\nCUT 2 from 4.5 seconds: Switch to close-up on the bowl, overhead low-angle shot, slight pan movement, emphasizing the rim tapping detail; Gu Can\'s head slightly raises, expression transitioning from despair to mild hope; cloth dynamics: attire remains static; environment reaction: light diffuses evenly, dust minimal; focus remains on the bowl\'s crisp animation.\\nFrom 6.5 seconds HOLD: Maintain medium shot composition, camera stable, Gu Can\'s body trembling slightly, the figure steps back, bowl held steady; micro-acting: slight eye movement showing awareness; cloth dynamics: clothes undisturbed; environment reaction: indoor silence, light uniform; extends the beat with sustained observation.\\nFrom 8.5 seconds TRANSITION: Camera slowly pulls out from close-up to wide-angle view of the alley, bowl vanishes, focus reverts to Gu Can\'s collapsed position; micro-acting: no emotional change; cloth dynamics: clothes settle; environment reaction: lingering dust, light fading subtly; concludes on a clear frame at 10 seconds, ensuring continuity with the beat.\"}}','{\"prompt_zh\": \"高端奢侈产品视觉风格，充满细腻奢华材质、优雅线条和柔和色彩，营造出现代都市与古风古装融合的高雅商业氛围，强调简洁背景和高端摄影质感。画面以细腻的光影和精致构图为主，突出人物与环境的互动。\\n\\n<Picture 1>：上一镜视频截图，锁定t=0，作为0-1.5秒过渡起点，展示上一镜结束时的场景。\\n<Picture 2>：本镜精绘目标构图，约1.5秒到达，显示巷中顾粲饿晕倒地，粗瓷碗递到面前，碗沿轻碰石阶的完整画面。\\n<Picture 3>：顾粲头像素材，锁定脸与身份，清瘦温和的少年脸庞。\\n<Picture 4>：顾粲基础造型素材，锁定朴素服装，略显苍白面容，体现善良性格。\\n<Picture 5>：破屋内环境素材，锁定破旧室内空间，压抑光线和周围元素。\\n\\n分镜详细描述（10秒）：\\n0-1.5秒 TRANSITION：从<Picture 1>的上一镜截图连续过渡到<Picture 2>的本镜精绘构图，采用缓慢镜头拉近效果，机位从地面视角升至中景，焦点从环境元素逐渐转移到顾粲的身体和碗，光线柔和地从阴影中溢出，布料动态轻微飘动，环境尘土在空气中微扬。\\nCUT 1 从1.5秒开始：固定机位为中景，高度眼线，镜头稳定，顾粲微微蜷缩倒地，脸庞沾着尘土，眼神无神微表情显示虚弱；递碗者（未指定）从左侧缓步靠近，粗瓷碗轻轻悬停在顾粲面前，碗沿在石阶上轻触发出细微声响；布料动态：顾粲的朴素衣裳随风轻微摆动；环境反应：破屋内光线从侧面窗户透入，尘埃在光束中悬浮；焦点变化：从顾粲脸部到碗的特写，保持清晰。\\n从2.5秒 TRANSITION：添加轻微推镜头，从中景推向顾粲倒地的特写，机位略升，突出碗的递入动作，顾粲微张嘴呼吸急促；微表情：嘴唇干裂，眉头轻皱显示饥饿；布料动态：衣角随风拂动；环境反应：石阶尘土飞扬，光线从窗户斜射。\\nCUT 2 从4.5秒开始：切换到碗的特写，机位从上方俯视，镜头轻微摇摄，显示碗沿轻碰石阶细节；顾粲头部微抬，眼神略显感激；布料动态：无直接影响；环境反应：光线柔和，尘土沉降；焦点保持碗的清晰。\\n从6.5秒 HOLD：继续中景构图，机位稳定，顾粲身体轻微颤抖，递碗者退后一步，碗保持在原位；微表情：顾粲眼神从无神转为一丝希望；布料动态：衣裳静态；环境反应：破屋内寂静，光线均匀。\\n从8.5秒 TRANSITION：机位缓缓拉远，从特写回到广角巷景，碗消失，焦点移至顾粲倒地全景；微表情：无变化；布料动态：衣裳保持原状；环境反应：尘土残留，光线渐暗；结束于顾粲倒地的静帧。\", \"prompt_en\": \"顾粲. Luxury product photography style with premium textures, elegant composition, high-end commercial aesthetics, clean background, emphasizing soft lighting and refined details. The visual is cinematic yet minimalist, blending modern urban elements with ancient rustic tones.\\n\\n<Picture 1>: Previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here, locking t=0 for the transition.\\n<Picture 2>: Current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not final freeze, showing Gu Can collapsed faintly, a coarse ceramic bowl held out in front, its rim lightly tapping the stone step.\\n<Picture 3>: Character portrait still of Gu Can; FACE identity lock only, emphasizing a lean, gentle-youth face.\\n<Picture 4>: Costume still of Gu Can named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only, locking his simple, slightly pale attire.\\n<Picture 5>: Front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only, focusing on the dilapidated indoor setting.\\n\\nTimed shot list for 10 seconds:\\n0-1.5 seconds TRANSITION: Start from the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1>, continuously morphing to <Picture 2> with a slow lens zoom-in and rise, camera height from ground level to medium shot, light transitioning from shadowed to soft illumination, cloth details gently swaying, dust particles floating in the air as the focus shifts to Gu Can\'s body and the bowl.\\nCUT 1 from 1.5 seconds: Fixed medium shot, eye-level height, stable lens, Gu Can collapsed with a faint, vacant expression, lips cracked showing desperation; the bowl slightly held out by an unseen figure, rim tapping the stone step with a subtle sound; cloth dynamics: Gu Can\'s simple clothes lightly fluttering in the breeze; environment reaction: light streaming through a window casts dust motes, background details static; focus shifts from Gu Can\'s face to the bowl for clarity.\\nFrom 2.5 seconds TRANSITION: Add a gentle push-in shot from medium to close-up on the bowl, camera rising slightly, highlighting the approaching figure and the tap action; micro-acting: Gu Can\'s eyes slightly lift with a hint of gratitude; cloth dynamics: no change; environment reaction: dust settling, light softening; intensifies the same beat by focusing on the bowl\'s movement.\\nCUT 2 from 4.5 seconds: Switch to close-up on the bowl, overhead low-angle shot, slight pan movement, emphasizing the rim tapping detail; Gu Can\'s head slightly raises, expression transitioning from despair to mild hope; cloth dynamics: attire remains static; environment reaction: light diffuses evenly, dust minimal; focus remains on the bowl\'s crisp animation.\\nFrom 6.5 seconds HOLD: Maintain medium shot composition, camera stable, Gu Can\'s body trembling slightly, the figure steps back, bowl held steady; micro-acting: slight eye movement showing awareness; cloth dynamics: clothes undisturbed; environment reaction: indoor silence, light uniform; extends the beat with sustained observation.\\nFrom 8.5 seconds TRANSITION: Camera slowly pulls out from close-up to wide-angle view of the alley, bowl vanishes, focus reverts to Gu Can\'s collapsed position; micro-acting: no emotional change; cloth dynamics: clothes settle; environment reaction: lingering dust, light fading subtly; concludes on a clear frame at 10 seconds, ensuring continuity with the beat.\"}',NULL,'2026-09-07T06:23:07.014598+00:00','2026-09-07T06:24:54.925425+00:00'),('871d71aff7e94ade','fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm','xjp-13d5f205a6914253','video_prompt','第1集 · 镜头 1','镜头视频提示词 · 第1集 · 镜头 1','succeeded',100,'deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B','工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\n模式：r2v\n指定时长：5 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 5 秒。\n画风代码：as_1002\n画风：奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background\n镜头标头：（无）\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事）：破屋内，昏暗的光线透过窗户照进来，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已经去世，母亲咳着血。窗外隐约可见几个人影在低声议论，背景是淅淅沥沥的雨声。\n说话人：（无）\n对白：（无）\n衔接：无上一镜衔接，直接从本镜精绘开始\n\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\n<Picture 1>\n- 素材类型: shot_render\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘首帧\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘首帧，时间码 0.00 秒的构图、机位和站位\n- English lock: approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘首帧（不是头像、不是空场景）；动作=破屋内，昏暗的光线透过窗户照进来，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已经去世，母亲咳着血。窗外隐约可见几个人影在低声议论，背景是淅淅沥沥的雨声。；出场=陈平安；场景=破屋内；职责=锁定 t=0 机位、构图、站位，后续运动只能从此帧向前\n- material detail: MATERIAL=approved shot render as first frame；ACTION=破屋内，昏暗的光线透过窗户照进来，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已经去世，母亲咳着血。窗外隐约可见几个人影在低声议论，背景是淅淅沥沥的雨声。；CAST=陈平安；PLACE=破屋内；DUTY=lock camera, composition, blocking at 0.00s\n\n<Picture 2>\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\n- 素材专名: 陈平安\n- 中文职责: 陈平安 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\n- English lock: character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=陈平安；身份=主角；男；child；娇小但挺拔，略显瘦弱；外貌=男性，五岁，黑色短发，大而明亮的眼睛，苍白肤色，小巧鼻梁；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=陈平安；IDENTITY=主角；男；child；娇小但挺拔，略显瘦弱；APPEARANCE=男性，五岁，黑色短发，大而明亮的眼睛，苍白肤色，小巧鼻梁；DUTY=lock face and identity only\n\n<Picture 3>\n- 素材类型: character_costume\n- 素材专名: 陈平安·基础造型\n- 中文职责: 陈平安 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装\n- English lock: costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色造型图；人物=陈平安；造型名=基础造型；服装=沉默寡言，眼神坚定，面对困境不哭不闹。头发微乱，面色苍白，穿着破旧衣衫，手中紧握陶罐。性格坚韧，内心隐忍，对母亲怀有深厚感情。；职责=只锁定服装与体态，不得改首帧站位\n- material detail: