: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=陈平安；IDENTITY=主角；男；child；娇小但挺拔，略显瘦弱；APPEARANCE=男性，五岁，黑色短发，大而明亮的眼睛，苍白肤色，小巧鼻梁；DUTY=lock face and identity only\\n\\n<Picture 3>\\n- 素材类型: character_costume\\n- 素材专名: 陈平安·基础造型\\n- 中文职责: 陈平安 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装\\n- English lock: costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色造型图；人物=陈平安；造型名=基础造型；服装=沉默寡言，眼神坚定，面对困境不哭不闹。头发微乱，面色苍白，穿着破旧衣衫，手中紧握陶罐。性格坚韧，内心隐忍，对母亲怀有深厚感情。；职责=只锁定服装与体态，不得改首帧站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character costume / turnaround；SUBJECT=陈平安；LOOK=基础造型；COSTUME=沉默寡言，眼神坚定，面对困境不哭不闹。头发微乱，面色苍白，穿着破旧衣衫，手中紧握陶罐。性格坚韧，内心隐忍，对母亲怀有深厚感情。；DUTY=lock clothing only\\n\\n<Picture 4>\\n- 素材类型: scene_plate\\n- 素材专名: 破屋内\\n- 中文职责: 场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间\\n- English lock: front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=场景正面环境图；场景=破屋内；环境=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；职责=只锁定空间与光线，不得改首帧人物站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=scene front plate；PLACE=破屋内；ENVIRONMENT=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；DUTY=lock environment only\\n\\n英文稿骨架（只学结构；锁图句换成上面清单里的专名和细节；动作链只写本镜，禁止抄屋顶/机甲）：\\n奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity with the first frame.\\nUse <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition.\\nUse <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only.\\nUse <Picture 3> as costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nAction chain for 5 seconds:\\nCUT 1: start FROM the exact composition of <Picture 1>, name the visible people and place, then describe camera move and the first beat of action.\\nThen continue with the next concrete motion (who moves, what changes in space, how the camera follows) until 5 seconds.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No readable on-screen captions.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"奢侈产品视觉风格，高端摄影风格，优雅构图，高端商业美感，干净背景。镜头从 <Picture 1> 的构图开始，时间码 0.00 秒，锁定机位、构图和站位：破屋内，昏暗光线透过窗户，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已逝，母亲咳着血，窗外隐约人影低声议论。使用 <Picture 2> 锁定陈平安的脸部身份，保持五岁男孩特征：黑色短发、大眼睛、苍白肤色。使用 <Picture 3> 锁定陈平安的基础造型，保持破旧衣衫和紧握陶罐的姿势。使用 <Picture 4> 锁定破屋内环境，保持室内光线和压抑氛围。动作链：0-1.5秒，从 t=0 开始，镜头缓慢上移，展示床铺细节和窗外人影；1.5-3.0秒，镜头拉远，保持人物静止，强调环境变化；3.0-5.0秒，镜头缓慢拉近，聚焦陈平安表情和母亲咳嗽动作，整个5秒保持连贯运镜，无跳跃，无回退。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background. Use <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition: dim light filtering through window, five-year-old Chen Ping\'an kneeling at the bedside, father deceased on the bed, mother coughing blood, faint figures outside whispering. Use <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only: male child, short black hair, large bright eyes, pale complexion. Use <Picture 3> as costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only: wearing tattered clothes, gripping a clay pot, silent and determined demeanor. Use <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only: interior of dilapidated hut,压抑 atmosphere with rain sound effect. Action chain for 5 seconds: CUT 1 at 0.00s: Start from exact composition of <Picture 1>, visible people: Chen Ping\'an and mother, place:破屋内. Camera moves slowly upward, emphasizing bed details and outside figures. First beat of action: Chen Ping\'an maintains kneeling pose, mother\'s coughing subtle change. Then continue: at 1.5s, camera pulls back to show wider environment, characters stationary; at 3.0s, camera slowly zooms in to focus on Chen Ping\'an\'s expression and mother\'s coughing action. Hold through full 5 seconds with smooth, elegant movements, no abrupt cuts or audio elements.\"}}','{\"prompt_zh\": \"奢侈产品视觉风格，高端摄影风格，优雅构图，高端商业美感，干净背景。镜头从 <Picture 1> 的构图开始，时间码 0.00 秒，锁定机位、构图和站位：破屋内，昏暗光线透过窗户，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已逝，母亲咳着血，窗外隐约人影低声议论。使用 <Picture 2> 锁定陈平安的脸部身份，保持五岁男孩特征：黑色短发、大眼睛、苍白肤色。使用 <Picture 3> 锁定陈平安的基础造型，保持破旧衣衫和紧握陶罐的姿势。使用 <Picture 4> 锁定破屋内环境，保持室内光线和压抑氛围。动作链：0-1.5秒，从 t=0 开始，镜头缓慢上移，展示床铺细节和窗外人影；1.5-3.0秒，镜头拉远，保持人物静止，强调环境变化；3.0-5.0秒，镜头缓慢拉近，聚焦陈平安表情和母亲咳嗽动作，整个5秒保持连贯运镜，无跳跃，无回退。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background. Use <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition: dim light filtering through window, five-year-old Chen Ping\'an kneeling at the bedside, father deceased on the bed, mother coughing blood, faint figures outside whispering. Use <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only: male child, short black hair, large bright eyes, pale complexion. Use <Picture 3> as costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only: wearing tattered clothes, gripping a clay pot, silent and determined demeanor. Use <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only: interior of dilapidated hut,压抑 atmosphere with rain sound effect. Action chain for 5 seconds: CUT 1 at 0.00s: Start from exact composition of <Picture 1>, visible people: Chen Ping\'an and mother, place:破屋内. Camera moves slowly upward, emphasizing bed details and outside figures. First beat of action: Chen Ping\'an maintains kneeling pose, mother\'s coughing subtle change. Then continue: at 1.5s, camera pulls back to show wider environment, characters stationary; at 3.0s, camera slowly zooms in to focus on Chen Ping\'an\'s expression and mother\'s coughing action. Hold through full 5 seconds with smooth, elegant movements, no abrupt cuts or audio elements.\"}',NULL,'2026-09-07T03:28:34.673233+00:00','2026-09-07T03:30:19.045347+00:00'),('8bb0edfec9834168','fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm','xjp-13d5f205a6914253','video_prompt','第1集 · 镜头 1','镜头视频提示词 · 第1集 · 镜头 1','succeeded',100,'deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B','工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\n模式：r2v\n指定时长：10 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 10 秒。\n画风代码：as_1002\n画风：奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background\n镜头标头：（无）\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事）：破屋内，昏暗的光线透过窗户照进来，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已经去世，母亲咳着血。窗外隐约可见几个人影在低声议论，背景是淅淅沥沥的雨声。\n说话人：（无）\n对白：（无）\n衔接：无上一镜衔接，直接从本镜精绘开始\n\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\n<Picture 1>\n- 素材类型: shot_render\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘首帧\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘首帧，时间码 0.00 秒的构图、机位和站位\n- English lock: approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘首帧（不是头像、不是空场景）；动作=破屋内，昏暗的光线透过窗户照进来，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已经去世，母亲咳着血。窗外隐约可见几个人影在低声议论，背景是淅淅沥沥的雨声。；出场=陈平安；场景=破屋内；职责=锁定 t=0 机位、构图、站位，后续运动只能从此帧向前\n- material detail: MATERIAL=approved shot render as first frame；ACTION=破屋内，昏暗的光线透过窗户照进来，五岁陈平安跪在床前，床铺上父亲已经去世，母亲咳着血。窗外隐约可见几个人影在低声议论，背景是淅淅沥沥的雨声。；CAST=陈平安；PLACE=破屋内；DUTY=lock camera, composition, blocking at 0.00s\n\n<Picture 2>\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\n- 素材专名: 陈平安\n- 中文职责: 陈平安 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\n- English lock: character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=陈平安；身份=主角；男；child；娇小但挺拔，略显瘦弱；外貌=男性，五岁，黑色短发，大而明亮的眼睛，苍白肤色，小巧鼻梁；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=陈平安；IDENTITY=主角；男；child；娇小但挺拔，略显瘦弱；APPEARANCE=男性，五岁，黑色短发，大而明亮的眼睛，苍白肤色，小巧鼻梁；DUTY=lock face and identity only\n\n<Picture 3>\n- 素材类型: character_costume\n- 素材专名: 陈平安·基础造型\n- 中文职责: 陈平安 造型素材「基础造型」，只锁定服装\n- English lock: costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色造型图；人物=陈平安；造型名=基础造型；服装=沉默寡言，眼神坚定，面对困境不哭不闹。头发微乱，面色苍白，穿着破旧衣衫，手中紧握陶罐。性格坚韧，内心隐忍，对母亲怀有深厚感情。；职责=只锁定服装与体态，不得改首帧站位\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character costume / turnaround；SUBJECT=陈平安；LOOK=基础造型；COSTUME=沉默寡言，眼神坚定，面对困境不哭不闹。头发微乱，面色苍白，穿着破旧衣衫，手中紧握陶罐。性格坚韧，内心隐忍，对母亲怀有深厚感情。；DUTY=lock clothing only\n\n<Picture 4>\n- 素材类型: scene_plate\n- 素材专名: 破屋内\n- 中文职责: 场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间\n- English lock: front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=场景正面环境图；场景=破屋内；环境=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；职责=只锁定空间与光线，不得改首帧人物站位\n- material detail: MATERIAL=scene front plate；PLACE=破屋内；ENVIRONMENT=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，