und；SUBJECT=陈平安；LOOK=基础造型；COSTUME=沉默寡言，眼神坚定，面对困境不哭不闹。头发微乱，面色苍白，穿着破旧衣衫，手中紧握陶罐。性格坚韧，内心隐忍，对母亲怀有深厚感情。；DUTY=lock clothing only\\n\\n<Picture 4>\\n- 素材类型: scene_plate\\n- 素材专名: 破屋内\\n- 中文职责: 场景「破屋内」正面环境素材，只锁定空间\\n- English lock: front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only\\n- 素材细节: 素材=场景正面环境图；场景=破屋内；环境=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；职责=只锁定空间与光线，不得改首帧人物站位\\n- material detail: MATERIAL=scene front plate；PLACE=破屋内；ENVIRONMENT=interior；一间破旧的屋内，陈平安跪在床前，父亲已逝，母亲咳血。窗外传来议论声，气氛压抑。；DUTY=lock environment only\\n\\n英文稿骨架（只学结构；锁图句换成上面清单里的专名和细节；动作链只写本镜，禁止抄屋顶/机甲）：\\n奢侈产品视觉。luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity with the first frame.\\nUse <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition.\\nUse <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only.\\nUse <Picture 3> as costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\nAction chain for 10 seconds:\\nCUT 1: start FROM the exact composition of <Picture 1>, name the visible people and place, then describe camera move and the first beat of action.\\nThen continue with the next concrete motion (who moves, what changes in space, how the camera follows) until 10 seconds.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No readable on-screen captions.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"奢侈产品视觉风格：luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background。使用<Picture 1>作为本镜精绘首帧，在0.00秒锁定机位、构图、站位。使用<Picture 2>作为陈平安的头像，仅锁定脸部身份。使用<Picture 3>作为陈平安基础造型，仅锁定服装。使用<Picture 4>作为破屋内环境正面，仅锁定空间。动作链10秒：从0.00秒开始，镜头保持稳定或缓慢移动，展示昏暗光线透过窗户、陈平安跪姿、母亲咳血、窗外人影议论。无硬切，持续10秒。\", \"prompt_en\": \"as_1002 style: luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background. Use <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 second