ior；一个即将崩塌的神秘洞天，周围是小镇和百姓，环境险峻，危机四伏。；DUTY=lock environment only\\n\\n英文稿骨架（只学结构；锁图句换成上面清单里的专名和细节；动作链只写本镜，禁止抄屋顶/机甲）：\\nCinematic realistic period-drama lighting, keep continuity: 0-1.5s bridge from previous last frame into the current render, then play this beat.\\nUse <Picture 1> as previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here.\\nUse <Picture 2> as current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue.\\nUse <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 骊珠洞天; space lock only.\\nAction chain for 5 seconds:\\n0-1.5s: start FROM the exact last-frame still in <Picture 1> (previous shot screenshot) and continuously transform into the current beat render <Picture 2>. No hard cut, no split screen.\\nFrom 1.5s to 5s: continue FROM <Picture 2>, name the visible people and place, then describe camera move and the current beat action until 5 seconds.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No readable on-screen captions.\"}]','{\"temperature\": 0.55, \"max_tokens\": 4096, \"timeout_seconds\": 300.0, \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B\", \"base_url\": \"https://api.siliconflow.cn/v1\", \"enabled\": true, \"episode_id\": \"xje-fac7e608fed748dc\", \"beat_id\": \"xjb-3590265b7a034a78\", \"duration\": 5.0, \"route\": \"r2v\", \"family\": \"minimax-h3-lightx2v-r2v\", \"visual_style\": \"\", \"pictures\": [{\"index\": 1, \"tag\": \"<Picture 1>\", \"role\": \"bridge_in\", \"material\": \"previous_last_frame\", \"name\": \"上一镜衔接帧\", \"label_zh\": \"上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点\", \"label_en\": \"previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here\", \"detail_zh\": \"素材=上一镜视频截图（默认末帧，可手动改截）；职责=锁定 t=0，0-1.5s 必须从此帧连续过渡到本镜精绘\", \"detail_en\": \"MATERIAL=previous shot video screenshot；DUTY=lock t=0; 0-1.5s must transform into the current render\"}, {\"index\": 2, \"tag\": \"<Picture 2>\", \"role\": \"shot_render\", \"material\": \"shot_render\", \"name\": \"本镜精绘\", \"label_zh