concrete motion (who moves, what changes in space, how the camera follows) until 10 seconds.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No readable on-screen captions.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"奢侈产品视觉：奢侈产品摄影，高级工作室灯光，优雅构图，高端商业风格，干净背景，保持与首帧连贯。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 1> 作为本镜精绘首帧，在 0.00 秒的构图、机位和站位；保持此构图。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 2> 作为陈平安的头像素材；只锁定脸部与身份。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 3> 作为陈平安基础造型的造型素材；只锁定服装。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 4> 作为破屋内环境的正面素材；只锁定空间。\\n\\n动作链：这段是 10 秒。\\n\\n从 t=0 开始，精确构图基于 <Picture 1>。可见元素：五岁陈平安跪在床前，母亲咳血，窗外有模糊人影低声议论。昏暗光线从窗户照入，高级灯光营造优雅氛围。机位静态，可能轻微跟随动作但不改变站位或布局。\\n\\n在 2 秒：陈平安慢慢抬头望向窗外，表情透露悲伤。相机轻微推进以强调动作，但保持初始构图。\\n\\n在 5 秒：陈平安站起身走向窗边，观察窗外雨景和人影。环境从 <Picture 4> 固定，服装和脸部从参考图锁定。\\n\\n在 8 秒：场景保持紧张氛围，雨声暗示，陈平安凝视窗外。无站位变化。\\n\\n在 10 秒结束时，保持原首帧构图，无变化。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Luxury product visual style: luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity with the first frame.\\n\\nUse <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition.\\n\\nUse <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only.\\n\\nUse <Picture 3> as costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\n\\nUse <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\n\\nAction chain for 10 seconds: Start from the exact composition of <Picture 1> at 0.00 seconds. Visible elements: Chen Ping\'an, a five-year-old boy with short black hair, kneeling at the bedside in a dilapided room. His mother is coughing blood, and faint figures outside are whispering. Premium lighting highlights the dim light from the window. Camera starts static and may slightly follow actions without changing blocking.\\n\\nAt 2 seconds: Chen Ping\'an slowly lifts his head to look towards the window, showing sorrow. Camera dollies forward slightly to emphasize the movement.\\n\\nAt 5 seconds: Chen Ping\'an stands up and walks to the window, observing the rain and figures outside. Environment from <Picture 4> reinforces the interior space; clothing and face locked from reference images.\\n\\nAt 8 seconds: Scene holds with implied rain sounds, Chen Ping\'an gazing out. No changes to blocking.\\n\\nEnd at 10.00 seconds with original composition maintained.\"}}','{\"prompt_zh\": \"奢侈产品视觉：奢侈产品摄影，高级工作室灯光，优雅构图，高端商业风格，干净背景，保持与首帧连贯。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 1> 作为本镜精绘首帧，在 0.00 秒的构图、机位和站位；保持此构图。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 2> 作为陈平安的头像素材；只锁定脸部与身份。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 3> 作为陈平安基础造型的造型素材；只锁定服装。\\n\\n使用 <Picture 4> 作为破屋内环境的正面素材；只锁定空间。\\n\\n动作链：这段是 10 秒。\\n\\n从 t=0 开始，精确构图基于 <Picture 1>。可见元素：五岁陈平安跪在床前，母亲咳血，窗外有模糊人影低声议论。昏暗光线从窗户照入，高级灯光营造优雅氛围。机位静态，可能轻微跟随动作但不改变站位或布局。\\n\\n在 2 秒：陈平安慢慢抬头望向窗外，表情透露悲伤。相机轻微推进以强调动作，但保持初始构图。\\n\\n在 5 秒：陈平安站起身走向窗边，观察窗外雨景和人影。环境从 <Picture 4> 固定，服装和脸部从参考图锁定。\\n\\n在 8 秒：场景保持紧张氛围，雨声暗示，陈平安凝视窗外。无站位变化。\\n\\n在 10 秒结束时，保持原首帧构图，无变化。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Luxury product visual style: luxury product photography, premium studio lighting, elegant composition, high-end commercial look, clean background, keep continuity with the first frame.\\n\\nUse <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition.\\n\\nUse <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only.\\n\\nUse <Picture 3> as costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; COSTUME lock only.\\n\\nUse <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 破屋内; space lock only.\\n\\nAction chain for 10 seconds: Start from the exact composition of <Picture 1> at 0.00 seconds. Visible elements: Chen Ping\'an, a five-year-old boy with short black hair, kneeling at the bedside in a dilapided room. His mother is coughing blood, and faint figures outside are whispering. Premium lighting highlights the dim light from the window. Camera starts static and may slightly follow actions without changing blocking.\\n\\nAt 2 seconds: Chen Ping\'an slowly lifts his head to look towards the window, showing sorrow. Camera dollies forward slightly to emphasize the movement.\\n\\nAt 5 seconds: Chen Ping\'an stands up and walks to the window, observing the rain and figures outside. Environment from <Picture 4> reinforces the interior space; clothing and face locked from reference images.\\n\\nAt 8 seconds: Scene holds with implied rain sounds, Chen Ping\'an gazing out. No changes to blocking.\\n\\nEnd at 10.00 seconds with original composition maintained.\"}',NULL,'2026-09-07T03:30:30.019894+00:00','2026-09-07T03:33:10.011803+00:00'),('cb253bf882ab4bd7','fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm','xjp-5a5d5e18261d4e29','video_prompt','第1集 · 镜头 1','镜头视频提示词 · 第1集 · 镜头 1','succeeded',100,'deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B','工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\n模式：r2v\n指定时长：5 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 5 秒。\n画风代码：（未设）\n画风：跟随项目设定，写实电影感，不要强行漫画字效\n镜头标头：（无）\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事）：骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗\n说话人：（无）\n对白：骊珠洞天即将崩塌，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人 殉道身陨，临终留下机缘与遗愿。\n衔接：无上一镜衔接，直接从本镜精绘开始\n\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\n<Picture 1>\n- 素材类型: shot_render\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘首帧\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘首帧，时间码 0.00 秒的构图、机位和站位\n- English lock: approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep this composition\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘首帧（不是头像、不是空场景）；动作=骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗；出场=齐静春、陈平安；场景=骊珠洞天；职责=锁定 t=0 机位、构图、站位，后续运动只能从此帧向前\n- material detail: MATERIAL=approved shot render as first frame；ACTION=骊珠洞天崩塌，齐静春和陈平安等人战斗；CAST=齐静春, 陈平安；PLACE=骊珠洞天；DUTY=lock camera, composition, blocking at 0.00s\n\n<Picture 2>\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\n- 素材专名: 齐静春\n- 中文职责: 齐静春 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\n- English lock: character portrait still of 齐静春; FACE identity lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=齐静春；身份=守护者；男；middle；外貌=男性，middle，黑色短发，灰色眼睛，中等肤色，方脸；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\n- material detail: MATERIAL=character portrait；SUBJECT=齐静春；IDENTITY=守护者；男；middle；APPEARANCE=男性，middle，黑色短发，灰色眼睛，中等肤色，方脸；DUTY=lock face and identity only\n\n<Picture 3>\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\n- 素材专名: 陈平安\n- 中文职责: 陈平安 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\n- English lock: character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=陈平安；身份=主角；男；youth；外貌=男性，youth，黑色短发，蓝色眼睛，普通肤色，圆脸；职责=只锁定脸与身份，不得改首帧站位或构图\n- material detail: MATERIAL=charact