ty lock only.\\nUse <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 骊珠洞天; space lock only.\\nAction chain for 5 seconds:\\nCUT 1: start FROM the exact composition of <Picture 1>, name the visible people and place, then describe camera move and the first beat of action.\\nThen continue with the next concrete motion (who moves, what changes in space, how the camera follows) until 5 seconds.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No readable on-screen captions.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"视觉风格：写实电影感，光影连续，营造史诗战斗氛围。参考图：使用<Picture 1>锁定t=0构图、机位和站位；使用<Picture 2>锁定齐静春头像，仅锁脸与身份；使用<Picture 3>锁定陈平安头像，仅锁脸与身份；使用<Picture 4>锁定骊珠洞天环境，仅锁空间。画面解说：这段就是5秒。0-1.5秒：镜头保持<Picture 1>构图，展示齐静春和陈平安在骊珠洞天战斗起始，崩塌效果开始显现，运镜稳定跟随人物动作。1.5-5秒：崩塌加剧，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人身体前倾阻挡，最终殉道身陨，镜头展现英雄气概和环境毁灭。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Cinematic realistic period-drama lighting, keep continuity with the first frame. Use <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep composition. Use <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 齐静春; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 骊珠洞天; space lock only. Action chain for 5 seconds: From 0.00 to 1.50 seconds: Start from exact composition of <Picture 1>, camera follows initial fight and collapse beginning. From 1.50 to 5.00 seconds: Collapse intensifies, 齐静春 sacrifices himself to protect the town, ending with the scene.\"}}','{\"prompt_zh\": \"视觉风格：写实电影感，光影连续，营造史诗战斗氛围。参考图：使用<Picture 1>锁定t=0构图、机位和站位；使用<Picture 2>锁定齐静春头像，仅锁脸与身份；使用<Picture 3>锁定陈平安头像，仅锁脸与身份；使用<Picture 4>锁定骊珠洞天环境，仅锁空间。画面解说：这段就是5秒。0-1.5秒：镜头保持<Picture 1>构图，展示齐静春和陈平安在骊珠洞天战斗起始，崩塌效果开始显现，运镜稳定跟随人物动作。1.5-5秒：崩塌加剧，齐静春为护住小镇百姓与陈平安等人身体前倾阻挡，最终殉道身陨，镜头展现英雄气概和环境毁灭。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Cinematic realistic period-drama lighting, keep continuity with the first frame. Use <Picture 1> as approved first-frame render at 0.00 seconds; keep composition. Use <Picture 2> as character portrait still of 齐静春; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 3> as character portrait still of 陈平安; FACE identity lock only. Use <Picture 4> as front environment plate of 骊珠洞天; space lock only. Action chain for 5 seconds: From 0.00 to 1.50 seconds: Start from exact composition of <Picture 1>, camera follows initial fight and collapse beginning. From 1.50 to 5.00 seconds: Collapse intensifies, 齐静春 sacrifices himself to protect the town, ending with the scene.\"}',NULL,'2026-09-04T07:01:37.597620+00:00','2026-09-04T07:03:15.911048+00:00'),('d0af4fe501ee466e','fSFuUlyixwjlc8xm','xjp-22a12dd8c5aa4aaf','video_prompt','第1集 · 镜头 2','镜头视频提示词 · 第1集 · 镜头 2','succeeded',100,'deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-0528-Qwen3-8B','工作流：LightX2V 多参考 R2V\n模式：r2v\n指定时长：10 秒。prompt_zh 与 prompt_en 都必须写明这段就是 10 秒。\n视觉风格代码：（未设）\n视觉风格：跟随项目设定，写实电影感，不要强行漫画字效\n镜头标头：（无）\n本镜动作（画面必须解说这件事）：魔物从裂缝中涌出，齐静春挥剑抵挡。\n说话人：（无）\n对白：（无）\n衔接：需要 0-1.5s 从上一镜截图过渡到本镜精绘\n\n【参考图装箱清单：每张图的素材类型、专名、外貌/服装/场景细节。英文锁图句必须用这些专名，禁止改成 hero / second character】\n<Picture 1>\n- 素材类型: previous_last_frame\n- 素材专名: 上一镜衔接帧\n- 中文职责: 上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点\n- English lock: previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; start here\n- 素材细节: 素材=上一镜视频截图（默认末帧，可手动改截）；职责=锁定 t=0，0-1.5s 必须从此帧连续过渡到本镜精绘\n- material detail: MATERIAL=previous shot video screenshot；DUTY=lock t=0; 0-1.5s must transform into the current render\n\n<Picture 2>\n- 素材类型: shot_render\n- 素材专名: 本镜精绘\n- 中文职责: 本镜精绘，约 1.5 秒到达的构图，不是全片结尾静帧\n- English lock: current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue\n- 素材细节: 素材=本镜精绘目标构图（约 1.5 秒到达，不是全片结尾）；动作=魔物从裂缝中涌出，齐静春挥剑抵挡。；出场=齐静春、陈平安；场景=骊珠洞天；职责=1.5s 到达此构图，之后从这里按本镜动作向前演\n- material detail: MATERIAL=current beat render as 1.5s target composition, not the final freeze；ACTION=魔物从裂缝中涌出，齐静春挥剑抵挡。；CAST=齐静春, 陈平安；PLACE=骊珠洞天；DUTY=arrive here by 1.5s then continue the beat action\n\n<Picture 3>\n- 素材类型: character_portrait\n- 素材专名: 齐静春\n- 中文职责: 齐静春 头像素材，只锁定脸与身份\n- English lock: character portrait still of 齐静春; FACE identity lock only\n- 素材细节: 素材=角色头像；人物=齐静春；身份=守护者；男；middle；中等身材，略显清瘦；外貌=男性，中年，黑色短发，深