e, then describe camera move and the current beat action until 10 seconds.\\nHold through the full duration. No <Audio n>. No readable on-screen captions.\", \"response\": {\"prompt_zh\": \"写实电影感，古代剧风格照明，光线柔和但富有戏剧性。 Use <Picture 1> 作为上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点，锁定 t=0。 Use <Picture 2> 作为本镜精绘目标构图，约 1.5 秒到达，之后从这里继续演进魔物从裂缝中涌出、齐静春挥剑抵挡的动作。 Use <Picture 3> 作为齐静春头像素材，只锁定脸与身份。 Use <Picture 4> 作为齐静春基础造型素材，只锁定服装。 Use <Picture 5> 作为陈平安头像素材，只锁定脸与身份。 Use <Picture 6> 作为陈平安基础造型素材，只锁定服装。 Use <Picture 7> 作为骊珠洞天正面环境素材，只锁定空间。 画面解说：0-1.5秒，从<Picture 1>连续过渡到<Picture 2>，运镜平滑，无硬切。1.5秒到10秒，从精绘构图开始，镜头推近，魔物从裂缝涌出，齐静春挥剑抵挡，陈平安侧身闪避，环境细节如崩塌的阵法显现，动作连贯，时长10秒。\", \"prompt_en\": \"Cinematic realistic period-drama lighting, with soft but dramatic illumination. Use <Picture 1> as the previous-shot last-frame still at 0.00 seconds; lock t=0. Use <Picture 2> as the current beat render; arrive by 1.5 seconds, then continue the action of monsters emerging from a fissure and Jiefeng挥剑 defending. Use <Picture 3> as the character portrait still of 齐静春; lock face and identity only. Use <Picture 4> as the costume still of 齐静春 named 基础造型; lock clothing only. Use <Picture 5> as the character portrait still of 陈平安; lock face and identity only. Use <Picture 6> as the costume still of 陈平安 named 基础造型; lock clothing only. Use <Picture 7> as the front environment plate of 骊珠洞天; lock space only. Cinematic action explanation: 0-1.5 seconds, transition smoothly from <Picture 1> to <Picture 2> with no hard cuts. 1.5 seconds to 10 seconds, start from the beat render, camera pushes in, monsters surge from a crack, Jiefeng swings his sword, Chen Pingyuan dodges, environment details like collapsing formations appear, actions continue fluidly for a 10-second duration. No audio or readable captions.\"}}','{\"prompt_zh\": \"写实电影感，古代剧风格照明，光线柔和但富有戏剧性。 Use <Picture 1> 作为上一镜视频截图，时间码 0.00 秒的衔接起点，锁定 t=0。 Use <Picture 2> 作为本镜精绘目标构图，约 1.5 秒到达，之后从这里继续演进魔物从裂缝中涌出、齐静春挥剑抵挡的动作。 Use <Picture 3> 作为齐静春头像素材，只锁定脸与身份。 Use <Picture 4> 作为齐静春基础造型素材，只锁定服装。 U